estinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747868\/width\/600\/height\/225\" width=\"551\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul style=\"list-style-type: circle\"> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Notebooks and monogrammed post-it notes<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Bridesmaids' stuff all together:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"bridesmaids packages.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747871\/width\/600\/height\/237\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Finally ready to start packing the bags!<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00328.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747875\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The Total Package\u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00333.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747877\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <em><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Templates and pricing coming up!<\/span><\/span><\/em><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Erica & Al - April 3, 2012 - St. Thomas, USVI<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong><span><em><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78715\/aciretas-planning-journal-april-3-2012-cruise-wedding\">Planning Thread<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/79320\/aciretas-wedding-ahr-pics\"><strong><span><em>Wedding & AHR Pics<\/em><\/span><\/stron