{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"255b7e1886226fd8d0f43177c793f734","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; \n Borrow away! I made the tops (powerpoint -&amp;gt; JPEG -&amp;gt; word) and just printed them on cardstock. The shorter bags&#039; tops were 6.6\" wide and 4.5\" tall, before they were folded in half. The treat bags&#039; tops were 5.5\" wide x 3.8\" tall before they were folded over the bags.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The clear bags were dollar store ziplocs and treat bags (large size) from michaels.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt; Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;stella331&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; I love the wedding vow OOT themed bags...I def want to \"borrow\" that idea. &amp;nbsp;Did you order postcards form Vistaprint for the bags? &amp;nbsp;If so what size did you get? &amp;nbsp;Also where did you get your clear bags? &amp;nbsp;They seem to fit the postcards perfectly!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; \n \n &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1591545,"PostDate":1331122737,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Borrow away! I made the tops (powerpoint -> JPEG -> word) and just printed them on cardstock. The shorter bags' tops were 6.6\" wide and 4.5\" tall, before they were folded in half. The treat bags' tops were 5.5\" wide x 3.8\" tall before they were folded over the bags.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The clear bags were dollar store ziplocs and treat bags (large size) from michaels.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span>Quote:<\/span><\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>stella331<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I love the wedding vow OOT themed bags...I def want to \"borrow\" that idea. \u00a0Did you order postcards form Vistaprint for the bags? \u00a0If so what size did you get? \u00a0Also where did you get your clear bags? \u00a0They seem to fit the postcards perfectly!<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Erica & Al - April 3, 2012 - St. Thomas, USVI<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong><span><em><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78715\/aciretas-planning-journal-april-3-2012-cruise-wedding\">Planning Thread<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/79320\/aciretas-wedding-ahr-pics\"><strong><span><em>Wedding & AHR Pics<\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ericataffs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.11.245.41","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1288606566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233628.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":197,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acireta","Id":233628,"Name":"acireta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e107dc599cea723a450398537f653a4a","RawContent":"These look great","Attachments":[],"Id":1591858,"PostDate":1331158667,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                These look great\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"realcdngirl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1330442869,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252057.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":147,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Realcdngirl","Id":252057,"Name":"Realcdngirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9cc980c42aa6466e54f0558be67d187c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; This is super helpful for putting together my bags. Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1591918,"PostDate":1331167045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> This is super helpful for putting together my bags. Thank you!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yumii28@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.193.203.38","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1322870103,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248280.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yumii28","Id":248280,"Name":"yumii28","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b370fb7f5c3045b2cfdc9fcd4a797a46","RawContent":"Thank you!  Did you glue the ribbon on the cards or just tie?\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]acireta[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n Borrow away! I made the tops (powerpoint -&amp;gt; JPEG -&amp;gt; word) and just printed them on cardstock. The shorter bags&#039; tops were 6.6\" wide and 4.5\" tall, before they were folded in half. The treat bags&#039; tops were 5.5\" wide x 3.8\" tall before they were folded over the bags. \n \n The clear bags were dollar store ziplocs and treat bags (large size) from michaels. \n \n Quote: \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1592072,"PostDate":1331211611,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you! \u00a0Did you glue the ribbon on the cards or just tie?<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>acireta<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> Borrow away! I made the tops (powerpoint -> JPEG -> word) and just printed them on cardstock. The shorter bags' tops were 6.6\" wide and 4.5\" tall, before they were folded in half. The treat bags' tops were 5.5\" wide x 3.8\" tall before they were folded over the bags.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The clear bags were dollar store ziplocs and treat bags (large size) from michaels.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span>Quote:<\/span><\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>46 booked and counting!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bellaangels@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1309473991,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241828.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stella331","Id":241828,"Name":"stella331","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d46ad5398f623333b74255dec56812d8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I just hole punched the sides (through the topper and baggie) and tied it. &lt;span alt=\";)\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1331227285380_151\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" width=\"16\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1592080,"PostDate":1331212997,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just hole punched the sides (through the topper and baggie) and tied it. <span alt=\";)\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1331227285380_151\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Erica & Al - April 3, 2012 - St. Thomas, USVI<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong><span><em><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78715\/aciretas-planning-journal-april-3-2012-cruise-wedding\">Planning Thread<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/79320\/aciretas-wedding-ahr-pics\"><strong><span><em>Wedding & AHR Pics<\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ericataffs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.11.245.41","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1288606566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233628.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":197,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acireta","Id":233628,"Name":"acireta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77ca91d7f0cbb08deb7a38b2741adc86","RawContent":"Thanks! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]acireta[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I just hole punched the sides (through the topper and baggie) and tied it. [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif[\/img][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1592083,"PostDate":1331213132,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Thanks!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>acireta<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I just hole punched the sides (through the topper and baggie) and tied it. <span alt=\";)\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1331227285380_151\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>46 booked and counting!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bellaangels@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1309473991,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241828.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stella331","Id":241828,"Name":"stella331","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a69f0b2b23cd2576c34c2b32a1742ed5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; These are AMAZING!&amp;nbsp; I LOVE LOVE LOVE The booklet\/package that had all the info and lanyards in it....&amp;nbsp; I may need to borrow that Idea!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; These are great I know your guests will Love them!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1592510,"PostDate":1331294849,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These are AMAZING!\u00a0 I LOVE LOVE LOVE The booklet\/package that had all the info and lanyards in it....\u00a0 I may need to borrow that Idea!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> These are great I know your guests will Love them!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jen.bonesz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"8.28.180.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1304700902,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239720.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"venus909","Id":239720,"Name":"venus909","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d5dc50038484bc05e2c817056bb3f0d0","RawContent":"This is amazing! I feel so bad for my guests ;)\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]acireta[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [size=2][font=arial]I absolutely loved making these bags! I think this was one of my favorite projects throughout this planning process, and I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m really excited to share them with you all.[\/font][\/size] \n \n [size=2][font=arial]We got the bags from Cheap Totes, and they were totally worth the price ($2.89). They\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re a nice large size with a big pocket on the outside, and the quality is great.[\/font][\/size] \n \n  [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747755\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] \n \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]I made tags for each bag on shimmer cardstock, and used a 3\u00e2\u20ac\u009d punch from Michaels (with a coupon of course!)[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] \n \n [size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747759\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img][\/font][\/size] \n \n \n [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]I did separate welcome packets for cruising guests and St. Thomas guests. I ended up making my own folders from black cardstock because I couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t find the right size folders I needed. I tied each folder with ribbon and a welcome monogram.[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] \n \n [u][size=2][font=arial]Welcome Packet Contents[\/font][\/size][\/u] [list]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Welcome postcard (Vistaprint) [\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[\/list] [size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747764\/width\/600\/height\/242[\/img][\/font][\/size] [list]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Wedding week events (Vistaprint) [\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[\/list] [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747766\/width\/450\/height\/700[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] [list]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Wedding day timeline (Vistaprint) [\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[\/list] [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747769\/width\/306\/height\/672[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] [list]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Photoshare business cards glued to one of the pockets (Vistaprint)[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[\/list] [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747771\/width\/600\/height\/344[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] &lt;ul&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"&gt;[font=arial][size=2][font=arial]St. Thomas postcards ([img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747773\/width\/312\/height\/402[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font]&lt;\/p&gt; [list]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Door hangers (Vistaprint)[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[\/list] [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747775\/width\/278\/height\/604[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] [list]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Photo release form for the cruising guests (from Carnival, see templates below)[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Recipe cards (from Jules23, Vistaprint)[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[\/list] [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747779\/width\/404\/height\/700[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"&gt;[font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Keycard\/tip holder on lanyard ([img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747781\/width\/600\/height\/448[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font]&lt;\/p&gt; \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial]Here&#039;s the whole welcome packet all put together:[\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747783\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747785\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747788\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img][\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747790\/width\/525\/height\/700[\/img][\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [i]To be continued...[\/i] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1593297,"PostDate":1331488220,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> This is amazing! I feel so bad for my guests <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>acireta<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">I absolutely loved making these bags! I think this was one of my favorite projects throughout this planning process, and I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m really excited to share them with you all.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">We got the bags from Cheap Totes, and they were totally worth the price ($2.89). They\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re a nice large size with a big pocket on the outside, and the quality is great.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00330.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747755\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">I made tags for each bag on shimmer cardstock, and used a 3\u00e2\u20ac\u009d punch from Michaels (with a coupon of course!)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00155.JPG\" height=\"392\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747759\/width\/600\/height\/450\" width=\"543\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span face=\"\">I did separate welcome packets for cruising guests and St. Thomas guests. I ended up making my own folders from black cardstock because I couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t find the right size folders I needed. I tied each folder with ribbon and a welcome monogram.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <u><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Welcome Packet Contents<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Welcome postcard (Vistaprint) <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"welcome postcard liberty.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747764\/width\/600\/height\/242\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Wedding week events (Vistaprint) <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"wedding week events.JPG\" height=\"605\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747766\/width\/450\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 295px; height: 481px;\" width=\"354\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Wedding day timeline (Vistaprint) <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"wedding day timeline cruising guests.JPG\" height=\"560\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747769\/width\/306\/height\/672\" style=\"width: 224px; height: 512px;\" width=\"223\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Photoshare business cards glued to one of the pockets (Vistaprint)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"photoshare cards for oot bag.JPG\" height=\"256\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747771\/width\/600\/height\/344\" style=\"width: 381px; height: 212px;\" width=\"470\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">St. Thomas postcards (<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"postcards from paradise.jpg\" height=\"323\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747773\/width\/312\/height\/402\" width=\"245\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Door hangers (Vistaprint)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"door hangers.jpg\" height=\"490\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747775\/width\/278\/height\/604\" style=\"width: 199px; height: 396px;\" width=\"196\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Photo release form for the cruising guests (from Carnival, see templates below)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Recipe cards (from Jules23, Vistaprint)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00228.JPG\" height=\"592\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747779\/width\/404\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 309px; height: 557px;\" width=\"308\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Keycard\/tip holder on lanyard (<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"photo 1.JPG\" height=\"347\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747781\/width\/600\/height\/448\" style=\"width: 444px; height: 312px;\" width=\"489\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Here's the whole welcome packet all put together:<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00158.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747783\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00159.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747785\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00162.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747788\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00161.JPG\" height=\"595\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747790\/width\/525\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 404px; height: 560px;\" width=\"436\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span id=\"cke_bm_51S\"  style=\"display: none\">\u00a0<\/span><em>To be continued...<\/em><span id=\"cke_bm_51E\"  style=\"display: none\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smoylan33@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1318151991,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246433.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":119,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Smoylan","Id":246433,"Name":"Smoylan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"01d0e702cf9d36efc4698a7bf3810c57","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I love your bags, Thanks so much for sharing!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595713,"PostDate":1331856609,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I love your bags, Thanks so much for sharing!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kateyesis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1312154737,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243058.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kks2012","Id":243058,"Name":"kks2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6539472a4103856e614e03831833dec1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow, these are awesome!&amp;nbsp; You are quite creative, I&#039;m so jealous. :)&amp;nbsp; Could I trouble you to email me your templates, please?&amp;nbsp; I don&#039;t have enough posts to access your templates for free.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:gf11277@yahoo.com\"&gt;gf11277@yahoo.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you so much!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595845,