{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237989.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"breathenagain22","Id":237989,"Name":"breathenagain22","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d197836c57be8b687417f2f835071602","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks everyone! Hope some of this stuff will help!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Someone PMd me and asked me for more pics of the recipe cards, so here they are:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"DSC00434.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765942\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Exceptional Mojito:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"DSC00436.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765944\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Traditional Jamaican Rum Punch:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"DSC00437.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765946\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Caribbean Rum Cake:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"DSC00438.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765949\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1596141,"PostDate":1332000206,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks everyone! Hope some of this stuff will help!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Someone PMd me and asked me for more pics of the recipe cards, so here they are:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00434.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765942\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Exceptional Mojito:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00436.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765944\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Traditional Jamaican Rum Punch:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00437.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765946\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Caribbean Rum Cake:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00438.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765949\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Erica & Al - April 3, 2012 - St. Thomas, USVI<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong><span><em><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78715\/aciretas-planning-journal-april-3-2012-cruise-wedding\">Planning Thread<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/79320\/aciretas-wedding-ahr-pics\"><strong><span><em>Wedding & AHR Pics<\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ericataffs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.11.245.41","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1288606566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233628.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":197,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acireta","Id":233628,"Name":"acireta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d3cdbcc84855fb3ad772e8e47aa9c707","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for the inspiration - guitar picks are so neat!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1596303,"PostDate":1332077030,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for the inspiration - guitar picks are so neat!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"terra.oconnor@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1329067498,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251320.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"terrad008","Id":251320,"Name":"terrad008","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ea3168cb4e410be48838a1983e561a8d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; WOW.. LOVE this Post.. Amazing ideas!! Thanks for sharing!! I can wait to use some of your ideas!! :o)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1596314,"PostDate":1332080925,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> WOW.. LOVE this Post.. Amazing ideas!! Thanks for sharing!! I can wait to use some of your ideas!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"britneyrasco@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1329416272,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251499.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissBubbles205","Id":251499,"Name":"MissBubbles205","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"785a2d8dbd048f0beebcf3a9604973ca","RawContent":"Great job. Thanks for posting the templates. i can&#039;t wait til i reached 150 so i can use them [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]acireta[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [size=2][font=arial]I absolutely loved making these bags! I think this was one of my favorite projects throughout this planning process, and I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m really excited to share them with you all.[\/font][\/size] \n \n [size=2][font=arial]We got the bags from Cheap Totes, and they were totally worth the price ($2.89). They\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re a nice large size with a big pocket on the outside, and the quality is great.[\/font][\/size] \n \n  [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747755\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] \n \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]I made tags for each bag on shimmer cardstock, and used a 3\u00e2\u20ac\u009d punch from Michaels (with a coupon of course!)[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] \n \n [size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747759\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img][\/font][\/size] \n \n \n [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]I did separate welcome packets for cruising guests and St. Thomas guests. I ended up making my own folders from black cardstock because I couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t find the right size folders I needed. I tied each folder with ribbon and a welcome monogram.[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] \n \n [u][size=2][font=arial]Welcome Packet Contents[\/font][\/size][\/u] [list]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Welcome postcard (Vistaprint) [\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[\/list] [size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747764\/width\/600\/height\/242[\/img][\/font][\/size] [list]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Wedding week events (Vistaprint) [\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[\/list] [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747766\/width\/450\/height\/700[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] [list]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Wedding day timeline (Vistaprint) [\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[\/list] [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747769\/width\/306\/height\/672[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] [list]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Photoshare business cards glued to one of the pockets (Vistaprint)[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[\/list] [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747771\/width\/600\/height\/344[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] &lt;ul&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;[font=arial][size=2][font=arial]St. Thomas postcards ([img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747773\/width\/312\/height\/402[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font]&lt;\/p&gt; [list]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Door hangers (Vistaprint)[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[\/list] [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747775\/width\/278\/height\/604[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] [list]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Photo release form for the cruising guests (from Carnival, see templates below)[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Recipe cards (from Jules23, Vistaprint)[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[\/list] [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747779\/width\/404\/height\/700[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;[font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Keycard\/tip holder on lanyard ([img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747781\/width\/600\/height\/448[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font]&lt;\/p&gt; \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial]Here&#039;s the whole welcome packet all put together:[\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747783\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747785\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747788\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img][\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747790\/width\/525\/height\/700[\/img][\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [i]To be continued...[\/i] [\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial] [\/font][\/size][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1596325,"PostDate":1332083592,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Great job. Thanks for posting the templates. i can't wait til i reached 150 so i can use them<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>acireta<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">I absolutely loved making these bags! I think this was one of my favorite projects throughout this planning process, and I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m really excited to share them with you all.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">We got the bags from Cheap Totes, and they were totally worth the price ($2.89). They\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re a nice large size with a big pocket on the outside, and the quality is great.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00330.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747755\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">I made tags for each bag on shimmer cardstock, and used a 3\u00e2\u20ac\u009d punch from Michaels (with a coupon of course!)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00155.JPG\" height=\"392\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747759\/width\/600\/height\/450\" width=\"543\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span face=\"\">I did separate welcome packets for cruising guests and St. Thomas guests. I ended up making my own folders from black cardstock because I couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t find the right size folders I needed. I tied each folder with ribbon and a welcome monogram.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <u><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Welcome Packet Contents<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Welcome postcard (Vistaprint) <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"welcome postcard liberty.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747764\/width\/600\/height\/242\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Wedding week events (Vistaprint) <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"wedding week events.JPG\" height=\"605\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747766\/width\/450\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 295px; height: 481px\" width=\"354\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Wedding day timeline (Vistaprint) <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"wedding day timeline cruising guests.JPG\" height=\"560\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747769\/width\/306\/height\/672\" style=\"width: 224px; height: 512px\" width=\"223\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Photoshare business cards glued to one of the pockets (Vistaprint)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"photoshare cards for oot bag.JPG\" height=\"256\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747771\/width\/600\/height\/344\" style=\"width: 381px; height: 212px\" width=\"470\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">St. Thomas postcards (<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"postcards from paradise.jpg\" height=\"323\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747773\/width\/312\/height\/402\" width=\"245\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Door hangers (Vistaprint)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"door hangers.jpg\" height=\"490\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747775\/width\/278\/height\/604\" style=\"width: 199px; height: 396px\" width=\"196\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Photo release form for the cruising guests (from Carnival, see templates below)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Recipe cards (from Jules23, Vistaprint)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00228.JPG\" height=\"592\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747779\/width\/404\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 309px; height: 557px\" width=\"308\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Keycard\/tip holder on lanyard (<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"photo 1.JPG\" height=\"347\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747781\/width\/600\/height\/448\" style=\"width: 444px; height: 312px\" width=\"489\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Here's the whole welcome packet all put together:<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00158.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747783\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00159.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747785\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00162.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747788\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00161.JPG\" height=\"595\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747790\/width\/525\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 404px; height: 560px\" width=\"436\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span id=\"cke_bm_51S\"  style=\"display: none\">\u00a0<\/span><em>To be continued...<\/em><span id=\"cke_bm_51E\"  style=\"display: none\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mzthan6@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1287412160,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233303.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mzthan6","Id":233303,"Name":"mzthan6","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4807fc5860be8297a41841d20e07bc70","RawContent":"Wow they turned out amazing! You have given me so many great ideas! Keep up the good work!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1596392,"PostDate":1332102554,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow they turned out amazing! You have given me so many great ideas! Keep up the good work!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Roberta.olea.burttram@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1332099686,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252881.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custo