an't wait until I have my 150 posts so that I can download these templates.\u00a0 Thanks so much for sharing.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"suzie_burnette@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.179.28.79","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1318248439,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246479.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Smitten","Id":246479,"Name":"Smitten","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3f1cbfbf6af4e8575bdf57a0f321cce0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; These are awesome!!! I feel lazy now lol I need to get to work on&amp;nbsp;designs for mine.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1598487,"PostDate":1332512985,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These are awesome!!! I feel lazy now lol I need to get to work on\u00a0designs for mine.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abrooke311@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1332462974,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253077.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"abrooke","Id":253077,"Name":"abrooke","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4d67dfe7a313a3a0883ff7aae2c3faa9","RawContent":"Sign up for their emails. They send out coupons daily, practically, for postcards, hats, pens, shirts, rack cards, business cards etc. You&#039;ll have to pay for shipping and any image uploads, but the base models are all free!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]spaterson[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n These are amazing!!! I need to start working on our. How did you score everything on Vistaprint for free?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1598495,"PostDate":1332513935,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Sign up for their emails. They send out coupons daily, practically, for postcards, hats, pens, shirts, rack cards, business cards etc. You'll have to pay for shipping and any image uploads, but the base models are all free!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>spaterson<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> These are amazing!!! I need to start working on our. How did you score everything on Vistaprint for free?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Erica & Al - April 3, 2012 - St. Thomas, USVI<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong><span><em><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78715\/aciretas-planning-journal-april-3-2012-cruise-wedding\">Planning Thread<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/79320\/aciretas-wedding-ahr-pics\"><strong><span><em>Wedding & AHR Pics<\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ericataffs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.11.245.41","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1288606566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233628.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":197,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acireta","Id":233628,"Name":"acireta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4b6775556381964c8dacb7856ca30d68","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Love the bags! You did a really awesome job!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1601787,"PostDate":1333219681,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Love the bags! You did a really awesome job!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"latteplease@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1332957296,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253324.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Josie Fiorda","Id":253324,"Name":"Josie Fiorda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21b0e15c423f7aac5e18264a46277dca","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; As always, you did a stellar job!!&amp;nbsp; I can&#039;t wait for details post wedding!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1604269,"PostDate":1333638006,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> As always, you did a stellar job!!\u00a0 I can't wait for details post wedding!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Its done.....you can read my planning journal or the review...long over due.<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/87359\/a-year-and-some-in-the-making-sorry-for-the-lateness-of-this-planning-journal-08-04-12-sunset-beach-resort-montego-bay-jamaica\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/87359\/a-year-and-some-in-the-making-sorry-for-the-lateness-of-this-planning-journal-08-04-12-sunset-beach-resort-montego-bay-jamaica<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lasonyadj@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1317037417,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245877.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrlddst","Id":245877,"Name":"mrlddst","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4ab514c6e15c3d34c34a7fb3d7794120","RawContent":"Hi everyone! We are in the car driving to Chicago from Miami, still in Florida so its going to be a long day. I&#039;m still absorbing everything from our trip, mostly realizing pictures I missed like giving out the bags, darn it! The bags were a huge hit! The most used things were the bags themselves, lanyards, pashminas and sudoku books surprisingly. I didn&#039;t think they&#039;d get used as much as they did. Anyway everyone loved them, I&#039;m really glad I did them, and I&#039;m sad and happy to be heading home :-)","Attachments":[],"Id":1604878,"PostDate":1333801744,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone! We are in the car driving to Chicago from Miami, still in Florida so its going to be a long day. I'm still absorbing everything from our trip, mostly realizing pictures I missed like giving out the bags, darn it! The bags were a huge hit! The most used things were the bags themselves, lanyards, pashminas and sudoku books surprisingly. I didn't think they'd get used as much as they did. Anyway everyone loved them, I'm really glad I did them, and I'm sad and happy to be heading home :-)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Erica & Al - April 3, 2012 - St. Thomas, USVI<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong><span><em><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78715\/aciretas-planning-journal-april-3-2012-cruise-wedding\">Planning Thread<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/79320\/aciretas-wedding-ahr-pics\"><strong><span><em>Wedding & AHR Pics<\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ericataffs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.11.245.41","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1288606566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233628.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":197,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acireta","Id":233628,"Name":"acireta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3fe1bef9d3fad870594b502c5e17f288","RawContent":"So sweet of you to update us! Have a safe trip home and don&#039;t worry about what you missed. [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]acireta[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hi everyone! We are in the car driving to Chicago from Miami, still in Florida so its going to be a long day. I&#039;m still absorbing everything from our trip, mostly realizing pictures I missed like giving out the bags, darn it!\n The bags were a huge hit! The most used things were the bags themselves, lanyards, pashminas and sudoku books surprisingly. I didn&#039;t think they&#039;d get used as much as they did. Anyway everyone loved them, I&#039;m really glad I did them, and I&#039;m sad and happy to be heading home :-)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1607108,"PostDate":1334308606,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> So sweet of you to update us! Have a safe trip home and don't worry about what you missed.<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>acireta<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hi everyone! We are in the car driving to Chicago from Miami, still in Florida so its going to be a long day. I'm still absorbing everything from our trip, mostly realizing pictures I missed like giving out the bags, darn it!<br \/> The bags were a huge hit! The most used things were the bags themselves, lanyards, pashminas and sudoku books surprisingly. I didn't think they'd get used as much as they did. Anyway everyone loved them, I'm really glad I did them, and I'm sad and happy to be heading home :-)<\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278364504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"284eb3d71aaaba34cab1b83f54045ec1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Love the bags! You did a wonderful job on them. Glad everyone&amp;nbsp;loved them.&amp;nbsp;I hope mine will be at least somewhat good. Where did you get the sunscreen? Thank you for the ideas.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1607690,"PostDate":1334482670,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Love the bags! You did a wonderful job on them. Glad everyone\u00a0loved them.\u00a0I hope mine will be at least somewhat good. Where did you get the sunscreen? Thank you for the ideas.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shellee2374@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1333234640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253436.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Shelgal","Id":253436,"Name":"Shelgal","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":142,"TotalPages":15,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":140},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
