   <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Have you both tested these to see if try held up with water?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mvee1025@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.177.132.210","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359850900,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265570.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mvee1025","Id":265570,"Name":"mvee1025","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cb45ef9ee6a0b9467c43e1bf96e65cd3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black;\"&gt;I LOVE how these turned out Jamie!&amp;nbsp; And I like that the sticker is clear.&amp;nbsp; It\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s always a great feeling when a project isn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t working out how you expected and then it turns out amazing.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1740034,"PostDate":1364562521,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color: black\"