font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black;\"&gt;f you don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t mind assorted colors, you can order them off their website.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.dollartree.com\/household\/kitchen-dining\/drinkware\/Double-Wall-Plastic-Tumblers-with-Straws-16-oz-\/756c726c727p329779\/index.pro?method=search\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"&gt;http:\/\/www.dollartree.com\/household\/kitchen-dining\/drinkware\/Double-Wall-Plastic-Tumblers-with-Straws-16-oz-\/756c726c727p329779\/index.pro?method=search&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1740037,"PostDate":1364562693,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color: black\">I tested the stickers I ordered from Davet Designs, and they really are waterproof.\u00a0 I hand washed them twice and I let them soak in water.\u00a0 They are not coming off!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color: black\">I purchased\u00a0my tumblers from the Dollar Tree. The colors I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve seen in store are Clear, Blue, Red, Orange, Green and Pink. I had to go to at least 3 stores to get all clear cups, and I had them checking to see if