{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75f1966c9f2dc3d73e33b6a5b4f6ac52","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]SamIAm85[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [size=2][font=arial][color=black]I tested the stickers I ordered from Davet Designs and they really are waterproof.  I hand washed them and soaked them in water, the stickers are not going to come off![\/color][\/font][\/size] \n \n [size=2][font=arial][color=black]I purchased the tumblers from the Dollar Tree. The colors I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve seen in store are Clear, Blue, Red, Orange, Green and Pink. I had to go to at least 3 stores to get all clear cups, and I had them checking to see if they had any more in stock in the back.    [\/color][\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial][color=black]If you don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t mind assorted colors, you can order them off their website. [\/color][\/font][\/size] \n  [url=\"http:\/\/www.dollartree.com\/household\/kitchen-dining\/drinkware\/Double-Wall-Plastic-Tumblers-with-Straws-16-oz-\/756c726c727p329779\/index.pro?method=search\"][size=2][font=arial][color=#0000FF]http:\/\/www.dollartree.com\/household\/kitchen-dining\/drinkware\/Double-Wall-Plastic-Tumblers-with-Straws-16-oz-\/756c726c727p329779\/index.pro?method=search[\/color][\/font][\/size][\/url][\/quote] \n Yeay!  I have a few Fast Sign shops near me, already have the cups and can&#039;t wait to get them to produce these labels.  You rock!","Attachments":[],"Id":1740211,"PostDate":1364607421,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>SamIAm85<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color: black\">I tested the stickers I ordered from Davet Designs and they really are waterproof.\u00a0 I hand washed them and soaked them in water, the stickers are not going to come off!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color: black\">I purchased the tumblers from the Dollar Tree. The colors I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve seen in store are Clear, Blue, Red, Orange, Green and Pink. I had to go to at least 3 stores to get all clear cups, and I had them checking to see if they had any more in stock in the back.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color: black\">If you don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t mind assorted colors, you can order them off their website. <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.dollartree.com\/household\/kitchen-dining\/drinkware\/Double-Wall-Plastic-Tumblers-with-Straws-16-oz-\/756c726c727p329779\/index.pro?method=search' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">http:\/\/www.dollartree.com\/household\/kitchen-dining\/drinkware\/Double-Wall-Plastic-Tumblers-with-Straws-16-oz-\/756c726c727p329779\/index.pro?method=search<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/a><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Yeay!\u00a0 I have a few Fast Sign shops near me, already have the cups and can't wait to get them to produce these labels.\u00a0 You rock!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mvee1025@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.177.132.210","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359850900,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265570.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mvee1025","Id":265570,"Name":"mvee1025","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a3ecd1ce62ed7774ec109e7a44394191","RawContent":"These are grea! What size stickers did you get? [quote name=\"SamIAm85\"]\nI ordered waterproof labels from Bridget at Davet Designs. [url=\"http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/DavetDesigns?ref=seller_info\"]http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/DavetDesigns?ref=seller_info[\/url] You can choose from different designs, sizing, etc. or use your own design.  I got 4 sheets (48 stickers) for $18.85 + $5.50 shipping = $24.35.  She was pretty quick, I ordered on a Friday evening and received my order the following Thursday (and I had her make one change after she set me the proof) [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194205\/\"]&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"194205\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"261\" src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194205\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194205\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"[\/url] style=\"; width: 350px; height: 261px;\" width=\"350\"&gt; [\/url][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1740334,"PostDate":1364662155,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                These are grea! What size stickers did you get? <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"SamIAm85\" url=\"\/t\/85507\/diy&#045;tumblers&#045;with&#045;pics&#045;share&#045;your&#045;designs#post_1884755\"><p>I ordered waterproof labels from Bridget at Davet Designs. <a href='http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/DavetDesigns?ref=seller_info' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/...ref=seller_info<\/a> You can choose from different designs, sizing, etc. or use your own design.\u00a0 I got 4 sheets (48 stickers) for $18.85 + $5.50 shipping = $24.35.\u00a0 She was pretty quick, I ordered on a Friday evening and received my order the following Thursday (and I had her make one change after she set me the proof) <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194205\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"194205\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"261\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194205\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"; width: 350px; height: 261px;\" width=\"350\"><\/span> <\/a><\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Ddmaust@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1341315233,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cd