{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":16,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":1092,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1899120,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":275203,"Name":"trbutler","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275203.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1435063712,"LastPoster":{"Id":279182,"Name":"Lia33","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279182.jpg?_r=1406769983","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":168,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":44,"Preview":{"Id":1899120,"PostDate":1435063712,"PostContent":"I must apologize for the delay in getting these posted, but better late than never, right? \u00a0I wan...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"trbutleress@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1384961990,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275203.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trbutler","Id":275203,"Name":"trbutler","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79307,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by trbutler, 23 June 2015 - 12:54 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1435064097,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e490201e99b40381c3aaf18ffe47e6c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I must apologize for the delay in getting these posted, but better late than never, right? &amp;nbsp;I wanted to share, because this forum was such a huge part of making our destination wedding a hit!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our OOT bags were a HUGE hit! &amp;nbsp;6 months later and people still talk about them!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;When putting together our gift bags I tried to be practical and include useful items, our wedding wasn&#039;t at an all inclusive so I didn&#039;t add any cups, etc. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Bag&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I looked forever for the perfect bag, and this was my final decision, and I was thrilled with my choice. &amp;nbsp;It had all the features I wanted, a bag that zipped closed, had an inside pocket with zipper and it also has an exterior storage area with a pocket. I am lucky because my mom has an embroidery business so so did the embroidery for me for FREE! &amp;nbsp; I wanted to my bags to be used after the wedding, so we didn&#039;t include a date or our names and just put a seashell &amp;amp; Aruba on each of the bags.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here is the link: &amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.thedealrack.com\/gemline-tote-bag-g1510-utility.html&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.thedealrack.com\/gemline-tote-bag-g1510-utility.html&lt;\/a&gt;The great thing about Deal Rack is they offer free shipping on any order over $50.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Like I said, everyone loved the quality of the bag, many of our guests would be out and other people at the resort would ask \"Where did you get that bag?\" &amp;nbsp;I probably could have sold some :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wedding Survival Kit&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These were a lot of fun to put together, I bought ziptop bags from Dollar Tree &amp;amp; printed my toppers from a template I got on here. &amp;nbsp;I would suggest buying these items a little at a time, when things are on sale, it helps that wallet a lot this way!The kits included:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Small pouches of KleenexGum\/Mentos&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Tic Tacs&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Aloe&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Small tube of sunscreen&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Shout Wipes&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Ibuprofen&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Aleve&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Pepto&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Zantac&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Rolaids&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Chap Stick w\/ SPF&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Imodium&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Off Wipes&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Safety Pins&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Emery Board&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;B&amp;amp;BW Hand Sanitizer&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also, I the price for Zantac and Aleve was crazy prices in individual packets so I made these:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":32628,"Name":"Wedding Gift Bags.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-275203-0-80216300-1435080028.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-275203-0-80216300-1435080028_thumb.jpg","Width":960,"Height":640}],"Id":1899120,"PostDate":1435063712,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I must apologize for the delay in getting these posted, but better late than never, right? \u00a0I wanted to share, because this forum was such a huge part of making our destination wedding a hit!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our OOT bags were a HUGE hit! \u00a06 months later and people still talk about them!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>When putting together our gift bags I tried to be practical and include useful items, our wedding wasn't at an all inclusive so I didn't add any cups, etc. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>The Bag<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>I looked forever for the perfect bag, and this was my final decision, and I was thrilled with my choice. \u00a0It had all the features I wanted, a bag that zipped closed, had an inside pocket with zipper and it also has an exterior storage area with a pocket. I am lucky because my mom has an embroidery business so so did the embroidery for me for FREE! \u00a0 I wanted to my bags to be used after the wedding, so we didn't include a date or our names and just put a seashell & Aruba on each of the bags.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is the link: \u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.thedealrack.com\/gemline-tote-bag-g1510-utility.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.thedealra...10-utility.html<\/a>The great thing about Deal Rack is they offer free shipping on any order over $50.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Like I said, everyone loved the quality of the bag, many of our guests would be out and other people at the resort would ask \"Where did you get that bag?\" \u00a0I probably could have sold some <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Survival Kit<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>These were a lot of fun to put together, I bought ziptop bags from Dollar Tree & printed my toppers from a template I got on here. \u00a0I would suggest buying these items a little at a time, when things are on sale, it helps that wallet a lot this way!The kits included:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Small pouches of KleenexGum\/Mentos<\/p>\n<p>Tic Tacs<\/p>\n<p>Aloe<\/p>\n<p>Small tube of sunscreen<\/p>\n<p>Shout Wipes<\/p>\n<p>Ibuprofen<\/p>\n<p>Aleve<\/p>\n<p>Pepto<\/p>\n<p>Zantac<\/p>\n<p>Rolaids<\/p>\n<p>Chap Stick w\/ SPF<\/p>\n<p>Imodium<\/p>\n<p>Off Wipes<\/p>\n<p>Safety Pins<\/p>\n<p>Emery Board<\/p>\n<p>B&BW Hand Sanitizer\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1899120]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-275203-0-95293400-1435078382.jpg\" title=\"Survival Kit.jpg - Size: 75.29KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-275203-0-95293400-1435078382.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Survival Kit.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also, I the price for Zantac and Aleve was crazy prices in individual packets so I made these:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1899120]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-275203-0-40446900-1435078482.jpg\" title=\"Medicine Packets.jpg - Size: 26.09KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-275203-0-40446900-1435078482.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Medicine Packets.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"trbutleress@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1384961990,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275203.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trbutler","Id":275203,"Name":"trbutler","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79307,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"858afb74bf20ec1020fd15da6353902e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;these look great!!! I really want to make these for our guest! Do you mind sharing the template to make the bag toppers ?@[member=\"trbutler\"]&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899126,"PostDate":1435065012,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>these look great!!! I really want to make these for our guest! Do you mind sharing the template to make the bag toppers ?@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275203\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275203-trbutler\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">trbutler<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>57 Guest","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422618588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79307,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a3fb8b72fd7cc27e8e4e7bfc911d24ac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;very nice! Where did you get the little bags for the zantac and aleve?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899132,"PostDate":1435067520,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>very nice! Where did you get the little bags for the zantac and aleve?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>So far 57 adult guests + bride and groom + 11 kids = 125 room nights. Focused on planning without stressing.","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401288470,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79307,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cce5f1110362395d35befb57e8218545","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Okay here is the rest:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Snack Bags&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These were a hit also, people loved these after getting back to their room from drinking, hanging at the beach, etc. &amp;nbsp;I simply bought gallon size ziptop bags from Dollar Tree and filled with:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Snack Size bags of Asst. Nuts - Costco&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Small Cans of Pringles - Costco&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cracker Packets&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Theater Size Candy - Starburst, Twizzlers, Swedish Fish, Mike &amp;amp; Ikes, etc&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Granola bars&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Boca Clips&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These were a HIT! &amp;nbsp;People loved these, after they figured out they weren&#039;t chips clips! &amp;nbsp;They aren&#039;t cheap, but well worth it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bedbathandbeyond.com\/store\/product\/boca-towel-clips-trade-set-of-2\/113349?Keyword=bocca+clip&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bedbathandbeyond.com\/store\/product\/boca-towel-clips-trade-set-of-2\/113349?Keyword=bocca+clip&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other Items&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sewing Kits from Micheals&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Pashmina - AC Moore&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Yankee Tins&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Loofa&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;ID Holder for room key, money, and ID&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Welcome Letter - this also included an itinerary and other important tips and info&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Balashi Beer - local beer in Aruba&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Aruba Tourism info we got from the hotel lobby&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And here is the finished product.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899136,"PostDate":1435068890,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Okay here is the rest:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Snack Bags<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>These were a hit also, people loved these after getting back to their room from drinking, hanging at the beach, etc. \u00a0I simply bought gallon size ziptop bags from Dollar Tree and filled with:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Snack Size bags of Asst. Nuts - Costco<\/p>\n<p>Small Cans of Pringles - Costco<\/p>\n<p>Cracker Packets<\/p>\n<p>Theater Size Candy - Starburst, Twizzlers, Swedish Fish, Mike & Ikes, etc<\/p>\n<p>Granola bars<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Boca Clips\u00a0<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>These were a HIT! \u00a0People loved these, after they figured out they weren't chips clips! \u00a0They aren't cheap, but well worth it.<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bedbathandbeyond.com\/store\/product\/boca-towel-clips-trade-set-of-2\/113349?Keyword=bocca+clip' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.bedbathan...word=bocca clip<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Other Items<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Sewing Kits from Micheals<\/p>\n<p>Pashmina - AC Moore<\/p>\n<p>Yankee Tins<\/p>\n<p>Loofa\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>ID Holder for room key, money, and ID<\/p>\n<p>Welcome Letter - this also included an itinerary and other important tips and info<\/p>\n<p>Balashi Beer - local beer in Aruba<\/p>\n<p>Aruba Tourism info we got from the hotel lobby<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And here is the finished product.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1899136]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-275203-0-57049900-1435083258.jpg\" title=\"Wedding Gift Bags.jpg - Size: 77.29KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-275203-0-57049900-1435083258.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Wedding Gift Bags.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"trbutleress@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1384961990,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275203.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trbutler","Id":275203,"Name":"trbutler","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.200.253.205","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79307,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"179da4391fa36cf9ea1c08c4f84cc1ad","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"trbutler\"] - Great bag!!&amp;nbsp; I can see why your guest are still talking about them!!&amp;nbsp; Where did you get the OFF wipes??&amp;nbsp; I want to include that in our bags too.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899138,"PostDate":1435069067,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275203\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275203-trbutler\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">trbutler<\/span><\/a> - Great bag!!\u00a0 I can see why your guest are still talking about them!!\u00a0 Where did you get the OFF wipes??\u00a0 I want to include that in our bags too.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Daisy<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can't wait to marry my best friend \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79500-janjins-planning-thread-azul-sensatori\/?p=1902797'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79500-janjins-planning-thread-azul-sensatori\/?p=1902797<\/a>","Email":"daisy.pitre@gmail.com","IpAddress":"142.255.87.125","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414946723,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Janjin","Id":280967,"Name":"Janjin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.196.12.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79307,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7dcc35249272b0f2ef0880b35f76bdf6","RawContent":"These are fantastic!  What was your budget for your OOT bags?  I&#039;m just getting started and these are all great ideas.\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1899139,"PostDate":1435069155,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                These are fantastic!  What was your budget for your OOT bags?  I'm just getting started and these are all great ideas.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"saramdavidson@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"166.137.139.111","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432492438,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsReed","Id":283225,"Name":"FutureMrsReed","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79307,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by trbutler, 23 June 2015 - 03:54 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1435074859,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"12d1793ed2c3882dc34ec6e41c0be730","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TheBHolders\" post=\"1899132\" timestamp=\"1435081920\"]\nvery nice! Where did you get the little bags for the zantac and aleve?[\/quote]\n@[member=\"TheBHolders\"] this is where I got them [url=\"https:\/\/www.bgpaper.com\/Details.asp?Product=23ZL\"]https:\/\/www.bgpaper.com\/Details.asp?Product=23ZL[\/url]they are a local store for me, so I didn&#039;t pay shipping.  But I am sure you can google this size bag or if you have a local paper supply place (more on the commerical side (Not PartyCity) they may have them.\n[quote name=\"racht33\" post=\"1899126\" timestamp=\"1435079412\"]\nthese look great!!! I really want to make these for our guest! Do you mind sharing the template to make the bag toppers ?@[member=\"trbutler\"][\/quote]\nI got these from another past bride.  Here is her post with the template\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/65045-my-oot-bags-are-done-tons-of-pictures-a-template-emstypes\/\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/65045-my-oot-bags-are-done-tons-of-pictures-a-template-emstypes\/[\/url]\n[quote name=\"Janjin\" post=\"1899138\" timestamp=\"1435083467\"]\n@[member=\"trbutler\"] - Great bag!!  I can see why your guest are still talking about them!!  Where did you get the OFF wipes??  I want to include that in our bags too.[\/quote]\nI got them at Walgreens they come in a pack of 12.\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.walgreens.com\/store\/c\/deep-woods-off!-insect-repellent-towelettes\/ID=prod6028493-product\"]http:\/\/www.walgreens.com\/store\/c\/deep-woods-off!-insect-repellent-towelettes\/ID=prod6028493-product[\/url]\n\nTo answer your questions @[member=\"FutureMrsReed\"], I spent about $30 per bag.  I had $9 in bocca clips,  which really increased the price.  I also only had to do 20 bags, so that helped a lot.  \n\nMy best advice is to start buying things now and during sales.  For example twice a year Bath &amp;amp; Body Works does a sale, check out what they have.  I also would search for coupons that I could print and help save some dollars.  I kept a spreadsheet with what I was spending and budgeted to make sure that it was practical purchases when I bought something.  Hope this helps!\n\nAlso, the folders I used for my welcome letters were left over from my wedding invitations.\nHere are some of the items included in the welcome packet:","Attachments":[],"Id":1899143,"PostDate":1435074328,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TheBHolders, on 23 June 2015 - 01:52 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>very nice! Where did you get the little bags for the zantac and aleve?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278146\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278146-thebholders\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TheBHolders<\/span><\/a> this is where I got them\u00a0<a href='https:\/\/www.bgpaper.com\/Details.asp?Product=23ZL' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.bgpaper....sp?Product=23ZL<\/a>they are a local store for me, so I didn't pay shipping. \u00a0But I am sure you can google this size bag or if you have a local paper supply place (more on the commerical side (Not PartyCity) they may have them.<\/p>\n<br><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>racht33, on 23 June 2015 - 01:10 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>these look great!!! I really want to make these for our guest! Do you mind sharing the template to make the bag toppers ?@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275203\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275203-trbutler\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">trbutler<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I got these from another past bride. \u00a0Here is her post with the template<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/65045-my-oot-bags-are-done-tons-of-pictures-a-template-emstypes\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...plate-emstypes\/<\/a><\/p>\n<br><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Janjin, on 23 June 2015 - 02:17 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275203\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275203-trbutler\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">trbutler<\/span><\/a> - Great bag!!\u00a0 I can see why your guest are still talking about them!!\u00a0 Where did you get the OFF wipes??\u00a0 I want to include that in our bags too.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I got them at Walgreens they come in a pack of 12.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.walgreens.com\/store\/c\/deep-woods-off!-insect-repellent-towelettes\/ID=prod6028493-product' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.walgreens...6028493-product<\/a><\/p>\n<br><p>To answer your questions @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283225\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283225-futuremrsreed\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">FutureMrsReed<\/span><\/a>, I spent about $30 per bag. \u00a0I had $9 in bocca clips, \u00a0which really increased the price. \u00a0I also only had to do 20 bags, so that helped a lot. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My best advice is to start buying things now and during sales. \u00a0For example twice a year Bath & Body Works does a sale, check out what they have. \u00a0I also would search for coupons that I could print and help save some dollars. \u00a0I kept a spreadsheet with what I was spending and budgeted to make sure that it was practical purchases when I bought something. \u00a0Hope this helps!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also, the folders I used for my welcome letters were left over from my wedding invitations.<\/p>\n<p>Here are some of the items included in the welcome packet:<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=32632\" title=\"Download attachment\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_extra\/mime_types\/doc.gif\" alt=\"Attached File\" \/><\/a>\n&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=32632\" title=\"Download attachment\"><strong>Wedding Welcome Letter 2.pub<\/strong><\/a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class='desc'><strong>215KB<\/strong><\/span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"desc lighter\">8 downloads<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=32633\" title=\"Download attachment\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_extra\/mime_types\/doc.gif\" alt=\"Attached File\" \/><\/a>\n&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=32633\" title=\"Download attachment\"><strong>Wedding Itinerary 2.pub<\/strong><\/a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class='desc'><strong>144.5KB<\/strong><\/span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"desc lighter\">4 downloads<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"trbutleress@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1384961990,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275203.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trbutler","Id":275203,"Name":"trbutler","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79307,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1435074691,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ea5617937a286ccbe0478061bcf0aee4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You did a great job!! They really look good, and I agree with the other ladies - it&#039;s no wonder your guests are still talking about them! The Deal Rack site is super - that&#039;s where our bags are from but the one you picked out is super practical! I love the embroidery!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For your survival kits - where did you find were the best places for the things you put in them? I know there are websites that the ladies have posted here that sell the travel size of things but just wondered if you had something else to add!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the post and the pics! Everything turned out great!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"racht33\"] If you just search at the top for survival kit you&#039;ll get the template. I added the one I put together here as well but you can play around and do almost anything you want to it!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899144,"PostDate":1435074516,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You did a great job!! They really look good, and I agree with the other ladies - it's no wonder your guests are still talking about them! The Deal Rack site is super - that's where our bags are from but the one you picked out is super practical! I love the embroidery!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For your survival kits - where did you find were the best places for the things you put in them? I know there are websites that the ladies have posted here that sell the travel size of things but just wondered if you had something else to add!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for the post and the pics! Everything turned out great!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281952\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281952-racht33\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">racht33<\/span><\/a> If you just search at the top for survival kit you'll get the template. I added the one I put together here as well but you can play around and do almost anything you want to it!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79307,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9467fbfaca3ef57bdaf29da2359e9a7e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"trbutler\"] @[member=\"acw271011\"] Thank you for the template !!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899145,"PostDate":1435075600,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275203\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275203-trbutler\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">trbutler<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> Thank you for the template !!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>57 Guest","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422618588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79307,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba29352efed635385ee63e3dd2b8f244","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;wow! i&#039;m sure your guests were raving about this for months! They looked great&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899147,"PostDate":1435075745,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>wow! i'm sure your guests were raving about this for months! They looked great\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79307","Title":"My Wedding Oot Gift Bags","LastPostDate":1435409468},"Pages":{"TotalItems":16,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
