{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79307,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"48037b11033a4eae1558af029472d567","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"] I shopped with coupons, but here is some ideas:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Small pouches of Kleenex&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Gum\/Mentos\/&lt;span&gt;Tic Tacs - I would look for them on sale at walgreens, CVS, etc - or I would go to Costco&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Aloe - I bought a large bottle at Christmas Tree Shop &amp;amp; Got empty bottles at DollarTree and added labels&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Small tube of sunscreen - Target 97&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(76,76,76);font-family:&#039;AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular&#039;, &#039;lucida grande&#039;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif, &#039;Segoe UI Emoji&#039;, &#039;Segoe UI Symbol&#039;, NotoColorEmoji, EmojiSymbols, Symbola, Noto, &#039;Android Emoji&#039;, AndroidEmoji, &#039;Arial Unicode MS&#039;, &#039;Zapf Dingbats&#039;, AppleColorEmoji, &#039;Apple Color Emoji&#039;;font-size:13px;text-align:justify;\"&gt;\u00a2&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Shout Wipes - Target 15&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(76,76,76);font-family:&#039;AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular&#039;, &#039;lucida grande&#039;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif, &#039;Segoe UI Emoji&#039;, &#039;Segoe UI Symbol&#039;, NotoColorEmoji, EmojiSymbols, Symbola, Noto, &#039;Android Emoji&#039;, AndroidEmoji, &#039;Arial Unicode MS&#039;, &#039;Zapf Dingbats&#039;, AppleColorEmoji, &#039;Apple Color Emoji&#039;;font-size:13px;text-align:justify;\"&gt;\u00a2 &amp;nbsp;- they had some crazy sale going on&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Ibuprofen -&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/Medifirst-Ibuprofen-Tablets-Compare-Advil\/dp\/B0006GDBXQ\/ref=sr_1_1?ie=UTF8&amp;amp;qid=1435090437&amp;amp;sr=8-1&amp;amp;keywords=ibuprofen+packets&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/Medifirst-Ibuprofen-Tablets-Compare-Advil\/dp\/B0006GDBXQ\/ref=sr_1_1?ie=UTF8&amp;amp;qid=1435090437&amp;amp;sr=8-1&amp;amp;keywords=ibuprofen+packets&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Aleve - I bought a big bottle and put in the small pouches&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Pepto - I bought it at Christmas Tree Shop and put a strip in each bag&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Zantac - I bought a big bottle when it was on sale and put in pouches&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Rolaids - Christmas Tree Shops&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Chap Stick w\/ SPF - Christmas Tree Shops in a 4 pack&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Imodium -&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/gp\/product\/B008ATM5ZQ?psc=1&amp;amp;redirect=true&amp;amp;ref_=oh_aui_detailpage_o07_s02&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/gp\/product\/B008ATM5ZQ?psc=1&amp;amp;redirect=true&amp;amp;ref_=oh_aui_detailpage_o07_s02&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Off Wipes - Walgreens they were one sale and I had a coupon&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Safety Pins&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Emery Board - Christmas Tree Shop&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;B&amp;amp;BW Hand Sanitizer - During an annual sale with a coupon&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899149,"PostDate":1435076411,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> I shopped with coupons, but here is some ideas:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Small pouches of Kleenex<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Gum\/Mentos\/<span>Tic Tacs - I would look for them on sale at walgreens, CVS, etc - or I would go to Costco<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Aloe - I bought a large bottle at Christmas Tree Shop & Got empty bottles at DollarTree and added labels<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Small tube of sunscreen - Target 97<span  style=\"color:rgb(76,76,76);font-family:'AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular', 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif, 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', NotoColorEmoji, EmojiSymbols, Symbola, Noto, 'Android Emoji', AndroidEmoji, 'Arial Unicode MS', 'Zapf Dingbats', AppleColorEmoji, 'Apple Color Emoji';font-size:13px;text-align:justify;\">\u00a2\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Shout Wipes - Target 15<span  style=\"color:rgb(76,76,76);font-family:'AppleSDGothicNeo-Regular', 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif, 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', NotoColorEmoji, EmojiSymbols, Symbola, Noto, 'Android Emoji', AndroidEmoji, 'Arial Unicode MS', 'Zapf Dingbats', AppleColorEmoji, 'Apple Color Emoji';font-size:13px;text-align:justify;\">\u00a2 \u00a0- they had some crazy sale going on<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Ibuprofen -\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/Medifirst-Ibuprofen-Tablets-Compare-Advil\/dp\/B0006GDBXQ\/ref=sr_1_1?ie=UTF8&qid=1435090437&sr=8-1&keywords=ibuprofen+packets' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.amazon.co...uprofen packets<\/a><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Aleve - I bought a big bottle and put in the small pouches<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Pepto - I bought it at Christmas Tree Shop and put a strip in each bag<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Zantac - I bought a big bottle when it was on sale and put in pouches<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Rolaids - Christmas Tree Shops<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Chap Stick w\/ SPF - Christmas Tree Shops in a 4 pack<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Imodium -\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/gp\/product\/B008ATM5ZQ?psc=1&redirect=true&ref_=oh_aui_detailpage_o07_s02' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.amazon.co...ailpage_o07_s02<\/a><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Off Wipes - Walgreens they were one sale and I had a coupon<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Safety Pins<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Emery Board - Christmas Tree Shop<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">B&BW Hand Sanitizer - During an annual sale with a coupon<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"trbutleress@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1384961990,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275203.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trbutler","Id":275203,"Name":"trbutler","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79307,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a0fb8d2d1c5093585116f36124930b3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I thought i was the only one who bought meds in bulk and put them in little pouches. I asked my brother the other day whether he felt as though that was bad but he said he wouldn&#039;t care. Did you hear anything from your guests? did they care at all?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899151,"PostDate":1435082030,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I thought i was the only one who bought meds in bulk and put them in little pouches. I asked my brother the other day whether he felt as though that was bad but he said he wouldn't care. Did you hear anything from your guests? did they care at all?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.180.69.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79307,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"27ba9920f98d3ba77f2f5c40044894be","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;These look awesome! Thanks for the templates and all the info! I love the bags you used too!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899154,"PostDate":1435082656,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>These look awesome! Thanks for the templates and all the info! I love the bags you used too!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amber_cover@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"64.180.69.208","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428842911,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282716.jpg?_r=1428872610","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amberc","Id":282716,"Name":"amberc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79307,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a99586bc0fd1d57667c2ebc6e1001164","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1899151\" timestamp=\"1435096430\"]\nI thought i was the only one who bought meds in bulk and put them in little pouches. I asked my brother the other day whether he felt as though that was bad but he said he wouldn&#039;t care. Did you hear anything from your guests? did they care at all?[\/quote]\nI didn&#039;t hear anything bad about it, but I have heard some brides on here say they didn&#039;t want to do it.  I think you need to know your guests, but some of the drugs are so expensive in individual packets.","Attachments":[],"Id":1899155,"PostDate":1435082764,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 23 June 2015 - 05:53 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I thought i was the only one who bought meds in bulk and put them in little pouches. I asked my brother the other day whether he felt as though that was bad but he said he wouldn't care. Did you hear anything from your guests? did they care at all?\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I didn't hear anything bad about it, but I have heard some brides on here say they didn't want to do it. \u00a0I think you need to know your guests, but some of the drugs are so expensive in individual packets.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"trbutleress@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1384961990,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275203.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trbutler","Id":275203,"Name":"trbutler","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79307,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3e9b54685d5b15a30117ea60bd3e91b5","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1899151\" timestamp=\"1435096430\"]\nI thought i was the only one who bought meds in bulk and put them in little pouches. I asked my brother the other day whether he felt as though that was bad but he said he wouldn&#039;t care. Did you hear anything from your guests? did they care at all?[\/quote]I&#039;ve seen it a few times on here. I think it&#039;s fine myself because you are friends and family.  You borrow meds all the time really.  I ended up not needing too but was considering it. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1899164,"PostDate":1435089746,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 23 June 2015 - 05:53 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I thought i was the only one who bought meds in bulk and put them in little pouches. I asked my brother the other day whether he felt as though that was bad but he said he wouldn't care. Did you hear anything from your guests? did they care at all?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI've seen it a few times on here. I think it's fine myself because you are friends and family.  You borrow meds all the time really.  I ended up not needing too but was considering it. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.6.114.66","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79307,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2fe2090226862c9775938fc374c1a6d9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I had went on Amazon and found boxes of advil and imodium containing 50 individual packets of meds that I will use for my OOT bags, on Amazon the price wasn&#039;t bad at all. The bag looks great!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899422,"PostDate":1435409468,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I had went on Amazon and found boxes of advil and imodium containing 50 individual packets of meds that I will use for my OOT bags, on Amazon the price wasn't bad at all. The bag looks great!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"limaldo96@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.196.202.228","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406462117,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279182.jpg?_r=1406769983","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":168,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lia33","Id":279182,"Name":"Lia33","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":16,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
