{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"372405d6877855d1c1b02e68c5e8ebe7","RawContent":"Justustwo,\n \n Have you posted any photos of your OOT bags. Did you get plain travel mugs or ones that were personalized?","Attachments":[],"Id":570798,"PostDate":1232815271,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Justustwo,<br \/> <br \/> Have you posted any photos of your OOT bags. Did you get plain travel mugs or ones that were personalized?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/good-times.webshots.com\/album\/573617153iUHYaT\"><strong>Our Wedding Day Slideshow<\/strong><\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46627\"><strong>Moon Palace Resort \/ Wedding Review<\/strong><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t37779\">OOT Bags<\/a><span> - - <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t40584\">Beach Towels<\/a><span> - - <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t43663#post825781\">Wedding Tanks\/Tees<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"hatla@arlut.utexas.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1231949973,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213940.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":63,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinaM2b","Id":213940,"Name":"TinaM2b","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8ec45614851f65abb173fe42f25814d","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;JUSTUSTWO&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;My big hits:\n The deck of cards\n First aid kit which had packets of Tylenol, Motrin, &amp;amp; Immodium, Purell hand wipes, &amp;amp; chapstick\n Flip flops for both men &amp;amp; women\n The mini-wallet used as a key card holder or for money\n The pashminas-the women loved them, especially for late nights in the lobby, on the beach &amp;amp; in restaurants for dinner.\n And yes, the travel mug was the biggest hit by far! Everywhere we went on the resort, my guests had their mugs. It was very convienent and well used at the bar!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n This is a GREAT thread! I&#039;m working on my OOT bag stuff now. \n Just wondering, JUSTUSTWO, since you did the flip flops...how did you know what size to get everyone&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; I really want to do the flip flops, but, we&#039;re having over 70 people and I can&#039;t figure out what sizes to get everyone! \n Any suggestions?","Attachments":[],"Id":570799,"PostDate":1232815375,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>JUSTUSTWO<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">My big hits:<br \/> The deck of cards<br \/> First aid kit which had packets of Tylenol, Motrin, & Immodium, Purell hand wipes, & chapstick<br \/> Flip flops for both men & women<br \/> The mini-wallet used as a key card holder or for money<br \/> The pashminas-the women loved them, especially for late nights in the lobby, on the beach & in restaurants for dinner.<br \/> And yes, the travel mug was the biggest hit by far! Everywhere we went on the resort, my guests had their mugs. It was very convienent and well used at the bar!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> This is a GREAT thread! I'm working on my OOT bag stuff now. <br \/> Just wondering, JUSTUSTWO, since you did the flip flops...how did you know what size to get everyone<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> I really want to do the flip flops, but, we're having over 70 people and I can't figure out what sizes to get everyone! <br \/> Any suggestions?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rweidelman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1201924861,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208442.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Rhonda","Id":208442,"Name":"Rhonda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02fc71ba0431d962b259f15481ee16c9","RawContent":"I agree, thanks for the great tips ladies!","Attachments":[],"Id":570812,"PostDate":1232816232,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I agree, thanks for the great tips ladies!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/1g9618ly5.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/1g9618ly5.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"melissadugas@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1211142613,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209468.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"~St.T Bride~","Id":209468,"Name":"~St.T Bride~","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"402da60a7ff10dc91422219fd4af4ebf","RawContent":"I found a bunch of travel mugs at the dollar store and was thinking of just getting waterproof paper and printing our monogram and sticking them on there? Anyone else done this? Good\/bad idea??","Attachments":[],"Id":570828,"PostDate":1232816989,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I found a bunch of travel mugs at the dollar store and was thinking of just getting waterproof paper and printing our monogram and sticking them on there? Anyone else done this? Good\/bad idea??\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/2;31;47\/st\/20080813\/n\/London+April\/dt\/-2\/k\/8ad7\/age.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...k\/8ad7\/age.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cindydarkhall@live.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1222679310,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212016.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cindy&London","Id":212016,"Name":"Cindy&London","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"07ba60d3c540972cc30219e868f65c97","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;TinaM2b&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Justustwo,\n \n Have you posted any photos of your OOT bags. Did you get plain travel mugs or ones that were personalized?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Here are a few pics that I found from my planning thread. I did get personalized mugs. I see that the pics are kinda fuzzy so I&#039;ll include the link to the album on Shutterfly:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8db28b3127ccec4466200fc3100000010O02EbtXDlsyZA9vPgo\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D720\/ry%3D480\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Here&#039;s just the OOT bag which came out way better than the pic shows:\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8db28b3127ccec446897a3d9600000010O02EbtXDlsyZA9vPgo\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D550\/ry%3D400\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n Here&#039;s the personalized travel mug:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8db28b3127ccec446d7733db000000010O02EbtXDlsyZA9vPgo\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D550\/ry%3D400\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n And a picture of the first aid kit (which had the band aids, meds, chapstick &amp;amp; hand wipe packets) &amp;amp; personalized pens that we ordered as well (ignore the ceremony fans). I also must say that the personalized pens were a hit too.\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8db28b3127ccec44600a5fca500000010O02EbtXDlsyZA9vPgo\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D550\/ry%3D400\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":570867,"PostDate":1232818897,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>TinaM2b<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Justustwo,<br \/> <br \/> Have you posted any photos of your OOT bags. Did you get plain travel mugs or ones that were personalized?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Here are a few pics that I found from my planning thread. I did get personalized mugs. I see that the pics are kinda fuzzy so I'll include the link to the album on Shutterfly:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8db28b3127ccec4466200fc3100000010O02EbtXDlsyZA9vPgo\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D720\/ry%3D480\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Here's just the OOT bag which came out way better than the pic shows:<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8db28b3127ccec446897a3d9600000010O02EbtXDlsyZA9vPgo\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D550\/ry%3D400\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> Here's the personalized travel mug:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8db28b3127ccec446d7733db000000010O02EbtXDlsyZA9vPgo\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D550\/ry%3D400\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> And a picture of the first aid kit (which had the band aids, meds, chapstick & hand wipe packets) & personalized pens that we ordered as well (ignore the ceremony fans). I also must say that the personalized pens were a hit too.<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8db28b3127ccec44600a5fca500000010O02EbtXDlsyZA9vPgo\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D550\/ry%3D400\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yvega98@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.167.150.138","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1188404700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207685.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JUSTUSTWO","Id":207685,"Name":"JUSTUSTWO","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f250c52e4be679830d5ce6d92a39ed6","RawContent":"Definitly include band-aids - I didn&#039;t and ended up needing them and the resort was all out!! WTF!! Luckily my MIL had them - also no one really used our Spanish for Dummies books either but everyone did think they were funny!","Attachments":[],"Id":570876,"PostDate":1232819405,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Definitly include band-aids - I didn't and ended up needing them and the resort was all out!! WTF!! Luckily my MIL had them - also no one really used our Spanish for Dummies books either but everyone did think they were funny!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"betsyrohr@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.103.44.199","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1193703120,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207887.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Betsy","Id":207887,"Name":"Betsy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23abacd4dd42182bcb0d4a3117073a02","RawContent":"Good thread! I will be picking up extra motrin for my OTT bags.","Attachments":[],"Id":570880,"PostDate":1232819565,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Good thread! I will be picking up extra motrin for my OTT bags.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smgemini@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1217226765,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210819.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":92,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SAM","Id":210819,"Name":"SAM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"af552c72142f2d5091c6b3f8467de954","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Rhonda&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;This is a GREAT thread! I&#039;m working on my OOT bag stuff now. \n Just wondering, JUSTUSTWO, since you did the flip flops...how did you know what size to get everyone&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; I really want to do the flip flops, but, we&#039;re having over 70 people and I can&#039;t figure out what sizes to get everyone! \n Any suggestions?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Basically I had everyone&#039;s email address so I just sent out 1 email to everyone asking for their size in t-shirts &amp;amp; flip flops. I mean it may have taken the surprise out of what they would be getting but I really wanted to make sure that I had the correct sizes. It worked very well but then I only had 30 guests to do this for, not 70! But I don&#039;t think you&#039;ll have a problem. \n \n If you do go this route, just make sure that the store that you are buying them from uses sizes in numbers as opposed to Small, Medium, Large. You don&#039;t want to ask your guest for sizes in #&#039;s only to find that the store has them in S,M,L! I had to learn this the hard way! LOL\n And also ask that they respond by a certain date so that you&#039;re prepared &amp;amp; only have to make 1 trip.\n \n I also made sure to do this when the flip flops were on sale for 2 for $5 and the store manager gave me an extra discount since I bought so many.","Attachments":[],"Id":570886,"PostDate":1232819887,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Rhonda<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">This is a GREAT thread! I'm working on my OOT bag stuff now. <br \/> Just wondering, JUSTUSTWO, since you did the flip flops...how did you know what size to get everyone<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> I really want to do the flip flops, but, we're having over 70 people and I can't figure out what sizes to get everyone! <br \/> Any suggestions?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Basically I had everyone's email address so I just sent out 1 email to everyone asking for their size in t-shirts & flip flops. I mean it may have taken the surprise out of what they would be getting but I really wanted to make sure that I had the correct sizes. It worked very well but then I only had 30 guests to do this for, not 70! But I don't think you'll have a problem. <br \/> <br \/> If you do go this route, just make sure that the store that you are buying them from uses sizes in numbers as opposed to Small, Medium, Large. You don't want to ask your guest for sizes in #'s only to find that the store has them in S,M,L! I had to learn this the hard way! LOL<br \/> And also ask that they respond by a certain date so that you're prepared & only have to make 1 trip.<br \/> <br \/> I also made sure to do this when the flip flops were on sale for 2 for $5 and the store manager gave me an extra discount since I bought so many.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yvega98@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.167.150.138","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1188404700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207685.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JUSTUSTWO","Id":207685,"Name":"JUSTUSTWO","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb0a54d90f58c7db010b67e352683534","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;kelleylove&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;have any of you done your own fun translation guides? I am American and marrying a British man and we constantly laugh at the translation issues... thought it might be cute to include a British\/English phrase book. What do you girls think?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Cute idea!\n \n Thanks for this thread. I&#039;m making my own English\/Spanish books (or my mom, is). We did buy the suduku books, though.","Attachments":[],"Id":570889,"PostDate":1232820014,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>kelleylove<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">have any of you done your own fun translation guides? I am American and marrying a British man and we constantly laugh at the translation issues... thought it might be cute to include a British\/English phrase book. What do you girls think?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Cute idea!<br \/> <br \/> Thanks for this thread. I'm making my own English\/Spanish books (or my mom, is). We did buy the suduku books, though.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissakayturner@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1221771925,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211814.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mel&B","Id":211814,"Name":"Mel&B","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2984aaf00b50f34c02791899b531f3fa","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Anthony&#039;sGirl&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I found a bunch of travel mugs at the dollar store and was thinking of just getting waterproof paper and printing our monogram and sticking them on there? Anyone else done this? Good\/bad idea??&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;A few BDW brides have bought travel cups &amp;amp; then personalized them with waterproof labels &amp;amp; markers.\n They came out really cute. I would do a few as tests to see how well they hold up before you buy them in large quantities.\n \n Here&#039;s a thread that I found that may give you some ideas:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t33350\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t33350&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n I knew someone on here had done this before so I went looking for the thread &amp;amp; found it.\n This thread has the pics of the mugs:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t13580\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t13580&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n And this one tells how she did it &amp;amp; what materials she used:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t13574\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t13574&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Morgan did these as well. Take a look at her planning thread:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t21764\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t21764&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":570896,"PostDate":1232820298,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Anthony'sGirl<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I found a bunch of travel mugs at the dollar store and was thinking of just getting waterproof paper and printing our monogram and sticking them on there? Anyone else done this? Good\/bad idea??<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>A few BDW brides have bought travel cups & then personalized them with waterproof labels & markers.<br \/> They came out really cute. I would do a few as tests to see how well they hold up before you buy them in large quantities.<br \/> <br \/> Here's a thread that I found that may give you some ideas:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t33350' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t33350<\/a><br \/> <br \/> I knew someone on here had done this before so I went looking for the thread & found it.<br \/> This thread has the pics of the mugs:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t13580' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t13580<\/a><br \/> <br \/> And this one tells how she did it & what materials she used:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t13574' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t13574<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Morgan did these as well. Take a look at her planning thread:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t21764' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t21764<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yvega98@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.167.150.138","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1188404700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207685.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JUSTUSTWO","Id":207685,"Name":"JUSTUSTWO","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1231,"TotalPages":124,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":1230},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
