\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This thread is GREAT! Thanks for the advice everyone.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"charconnors@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1212011019,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209629.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jamaica2009bride","Id":209629,"Name":"jamaica2009bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2961d97fbb4960a3a539816a6d54894","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;jojoboone1109&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;great thread, good for us newbies.. never thought about the first aid kit! does anyone know where you can get custom stickers to stick on the oot bags?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I am going to make my own logo and use iron on transfers for the bags.","Attachments":[],"Id":572665,"PostDate":1233000677,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>jojoboone1109<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">great thread, good for us newbies.. never thought about the first aid kit! does anyone know where you can get custom stickers to stick on the oot bags?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I am going to make my own logo and use iron on transfers for the bags.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by: Cineart Photographywww.cineartphotography.com<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.cineartphotography.com\/2009\/amy\">Our Professional Slideshow<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"afudgie@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1223403492,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212170.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"fudgie","Id":212170,"Name":"fudgie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b13df4af091d1e293b7450b2d930f0c","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Anthony&#039;sGirl&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Well this is what I have so far for my OOT Bags. My FI made a good point about the hand wipes.. there is only one! So, I&#039;m putting those into the First Aid kits so they don&#039;t go to waste and getting the little bottles of sanitizer instead. &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;If you really want to use the hand wipes instead of the bottles, you can look for the box of individually wrapped Purell wipes. There were more than 100 in the box so I was able to give several packets to each guest. I just put them right into the first aid kit too. I think I got those from Staples as well.\n \n The box looks like this:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/gp\/product\/images\/B0002LGUC4\/ref=dp_otherviews_1?ie=UTF8&amp;amp;s=hpc&amp;amp;img=1\"&gt;http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/gp\/product\/ima...F8&amp;amp;s=hpc&amp;amp;img=1&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n And each was individually wrapped like this:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/INDUSTRIES-GOJ902210BX-Premoistened-Sanitizing-Individually\/dp\/B000FZ23FA\/ref=pd_sim_hpc_1\"&gt;http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/INDUSTRIES-GOJ...f=pd_sim_hpc_1&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":572683,"PostDate":1233001581,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Anthony'sGirl<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Well this is what I have so far for my OOT Bags. My FI made a good point about the hand wipes.. there is only one! So, I'm putting those into the First Aid kits so they don't go to waste and getting the little bottles of sanitizer instead. <\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>If you really want to use the hand wipes instead of the bottles, you can look for the box of individually wrapped Purell wipes. There were more than 100 in the box so I was able to give several packets to each guest. I just put them right into the first aid kit too. I think I got those from Staples as well.<br \/> <br \/> The box looks like this:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/gp\/product\/images\/B0002LGUC4\/ref=dp_otherviews_1?ie=UTF8&s=hpc&img=1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.amazon.co....F8&s=hpc&img=1<\/a><br \/> <br \/> And each was individually wrapped like this:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/INDUSTRIES-GOJ902210BX-Premoistened-Sanitizing-Individually\/dp\/B000FZ23FA\/ref=pd_sim_hpc_1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.amazon.co....f=pd_sim_hpc_1<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yvega98@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.167.150.138","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1188404700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207685.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JUSTUSTWO","Id":207685,"Name":"JUSTUSTWO","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1bdba5754b7e4168352f1dcc26ac0233","RawContent":"Great!! I was just at Staples.. didn&#039;t even think to look for those kind of things there :) Thank you!","Attachments":[],"Id":572690,"PostDate":1233001857,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great!! I was just at Staples.. didn't even think to look for those kind of things there <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Thank you!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/2;31;47\/st\/20080813\/n\/London+April\/dt\/-2\/k\/8ad7\/age.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...k\/8ad7\/age.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cindydarkhall@live.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1222679310,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212016.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cindy&London","Id":212016,"Name":"Cindy&London","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6c9c51b1fe3f17e12ab228c4987b3663","RawContent":"This is a fab thread for hits and misses.\n \n Thanks.","Attachments":[],"Id":573203,"PostDate":1233067384,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This is a fab thread for hits and misses.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kayruddy1@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1232208377,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214034.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kayr","Id":214034,"Name":"kayr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ba4357abee502ed7d7a4587b0e2d934","RawContent":"Best thread for OOT bag info! Thank you!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":573860,"PostDate":1233098614,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Best thread for OOT bag info! Thank you!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rrsmile44@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1217872196,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210970.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RRsmile","Id":210970,"Name":"RRsmile","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ded653a38e9ffc9d42e8296c27130ca9","RawContent":"I just got those hand sanitizers-I think that they are a great idea!","Attachments":[],"Id":573869,"PostDate":1233099186,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just got those hand sanitizers-I think that they are a great idea!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i371.photobucket.com\/albums\/oo151\/blkatz\/picture14-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i371.photobucket.com\/albums\/o...icture14-1.jpg<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/claudiaphoto.com\/slideshows\/erick\/may\/beth_jay\/\">My pro Pictures from Erick Rodriguez<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/cancunweddingvideo.com\/wedding\/beth_jay\/\">Our Wedding Video from Cancun Wedding Video<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/JicQm4\/.png\">http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/JicQm4\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bethkatz12@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1213103626,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209860.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":73,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Blkatz","Id":209860,"Name":"Blkatz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e7d3e6e852b56bfd98bcef7abad2f174","RawContent":"We are going to include a book (not sure if we&#039;ll do all the same or a few) since we&#039;ll be at the beach and I know I always run out of reading material on the plane! We figured if there is some overlap it will also give guests that don&#039;t know each other well something to talk about. Kind of like a big wedding book club of sorts. We haven&#039;t done it yet so I don&#039;t know if it&#039;ll go over well; I&#039;ll let you know! We&#039;ll probably try to find a book by a PV author or with PV as the setting.","Attachments":[],"Id":574375,"PostDate":1233155224,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are going to include a book (not sure if we'll do all the same or a few) since we'll be at the beach and I know I always run out of reading material on the plane! We figured if there is some overlap it will also give guests that don't know each other well something to talk about. Kind of like a big wedding book club of sorts. We haven't done it yet so I don't know if it'll go over well; I'll let you know! We'll probably try to find a book by a PV author or with PV as the setting.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>We're married! Jamie<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"smith3576@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1226120379,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212590.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"smith3576","Id":212590,"Name":"smith3576","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d4ea40ccf64fca1d01c6795f8c166712","RawContent":"I have one thing to add that may be a little pricey but would have come in very handy - a small USB memory stick. A few of us had laptops so were downloading the picture cards from each other&#039;s cameras, but it would have been great to be able to put all pictures on one laptop and store the photos to a USB port for everyone. I am not that tech savvy so am unsure how big of a memory stick you would need, but I would think a 1G would have been enough.\n \n Also, we used paper bags because I thought all of my guests were seasoned travelers and would have their own beach bags but many of them either didn&#039;t have one or forgot theirs, so I wish I would have spent the money on beach bags (for the women at least - the guys wouldn&#039;t have used them).","Attachments":[],"Id":576231,"PostDate":1233260228,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have one thing to add that may be a little pricey but would have come in very handy - a small USB memory stick. A few of us had laptops so were downloading the picture cards from each other's cameras, but it would have been great to be able to put all pictures on one laptop and store the photos to a USB port for everyone. I am not that tech savvy so am unsure how big of a memory stick you would need, but I would think a 1G would have been enough.<br \/> <br \/> Also, we used paper bags because I thought all of my guests were seasoned travelers and would have their own beach bags but many of them either didn't have one or forgot theirs, so I wish I would have spent the money on beach bags (for the women at least - the guys wouldn't have used them).\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leslie_lyman@umanitoba.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1225204080,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212437.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"monkey","Id":212437,"Name":"monkey","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1231,"TotalPages":124,"CurrentPage":60,"NextPage":70,"PreviousPage":50,"LastPage":1230},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
