{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":122776,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that snswedding2016 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1906281\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" I don't even know what to say. I'm so sorry to hear that your son has cancelled his trip...especially so close to you leaving. I know how excited you were to get some good family time and can't imagine the disappointment you must be feeling but all I can say is what Sean always tells me when we've hit snags in the road during this wedding planning process...that this is about the two of you. Of course we want all of our closest loved ones there to celebrate with but at the end of the day this day\/wedding week will be about you and Doug and how special it will be to renew your love for each other in paradise! Sending you big hugs!!!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444871644,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122752,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThanks ladies! 5 days to go and one week today for our renewal! And of course I broke TWO nails!!! It couldn't be just one. It had to be TWO!! So now I have to get them filled because they look so ridiculous. Oh well.\n \n@RivieraBride15  @Wafflesmom  Thank you both. T...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1906204\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1444491864","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444851261,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122696,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nmaybeoneday just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThanks ladies! 5 days to go and one week today for our renewal! And of course I broke TWO nails!!! It couldn't be just one. It had to be TWO!! So now I have to get them filled because they look so ridiculous. Oh well.\n \n@RivieraBride15  @Wafflesmom  Thank you both. T...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1906204\n","Sender":{"Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1444824085,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122694,"Title":"liked a post you made in Turning Maybeoneday's D...","Message":"Hello!\n\nmaybeoneday just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI know we've already messaged a few times this morning but happy wedding day anyway!! I hope it's absolutely fab and you get a ton of photos that you'll post!!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79411-turning-maybeonedays-dream-to-reality\/?view=findpost&p=1906256\n","Sender":{"Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1444823936,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122677,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that snswedding2016 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1906258\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" Thank you!!! That's perfect! I'm going to show this to Sean tonight. It looks great!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444822617,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122659,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"acw271011,\n\nperianjay has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Your dress\".\n\nperianjay said:\n======================================================================\nOh and I forgot to answer your question about inquiries to the US. 95% of my inquiry was actually from the US.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=11745&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444821025,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11745},{"Id":122655,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"acw271011,\n\nperianjay has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Your dress\".\n\nperianjay said:\n======================================================================\nHi!!\n \nOk so i'm going to be perfectly honest..pre-owned wedding dresses wasn't amazing for me.\n \nI posted my dress back in early May and I JUST took it off of the website last night. I got no serious inquiry. I got a handful of emails from people who seemed really interested and then i'd reply and get no response. I ended up selling my dress by posting it on the Ontario wedding swap and sell facebook group. I left the group after I sold my dress, but that was my best bet. I ended up having to sell the dress for a lot less than I wanted to ($500), but I just wanted to get rid of it so that I could get my new dress.\n \nI'm sure not everyone has the same experience. Mine was truly unique because my dress was really small so it didn't appeal to many people. I wished now that it had have been a larger size since it's much easier for someone to take a dress in than it is for them to fit themselves into a size 2 dress.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=11745&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444820773,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11745},{"Id":122596,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"acw271011,\n\nTinkerSofi has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Photos\".\n\nTinkerSofi said:\n======================================================================\nstil no luck, the page keeps freezing. Only a few loaded, I made a gallery with them on my profile. I'll try again tomorrow <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=11743&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444786691,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11743},{"Id":122595,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"acw271011,\n\nTinkerSofi has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Photos\".\n\nTinkerSofi said:\n======================================================================\nOh, long story short, after waiting for about an hour for them to upload something went wrong with the website and they didn't upload <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>. Then I got busy and haven't had a chance to upload them again. I'll try tonight since I just got home from the gym and I have way too much energy haha. Let's hope it works this time! I was able to load them up on the facebook group of azul fives brides but not here <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\n \n \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=11743&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444785251,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11743},{"Id":122586,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nsnswedding2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"snswedding2016\" data-cid=\"1906227\" data-time=\"1444770249\">@  I can't believe you leave this week!!!! So so excited for you! It all looks fantastic! You look stunning in your dress!!\n \nDo you have a pic of the dufflebag you g...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1906240\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444780972,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122564,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nAahhh!  6 days until we leave for Mexico! And finally getting organized I think. Quiet thanksgiving for us today after getting back from the US late last night for the grandsons' birthdays. And I got to pick up my goodies too!! Very happy with everything. Well worth the wait!\n ...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1906173\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444778963,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122557,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThanks ladies! 5 days to go and one week today for our renewal! And of course I broke TWO nails!!! It couldn't be just one. It had to be TWO!! So now I have to get them filled because they look so ridiculous. Oh well.\n \n@RivieraBride15  @Wafflesmom  Thank you both. T...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1906204\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444778302,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122527,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Wafflesmom mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1906229\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"deecol\" I know! We'll be at double digit countdown by Saturday  During your family Thanksgiving get-together, we started watching YouTube videos of Moon Palace be it was nice to see how excited they were for our wedding. \n\n@\"acw271011\" thank you so much for the kind words. I'm still hurt by my friend's decision but in the end, that's her choice and I'm not gonna dwell on it or let it get me down. If she doesn't want to be there, that's ok because the ones who truly matter will be by our side.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1444491864","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444764024,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122522,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wafflesmom Moon Palace Plan...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@Wafflesmom  I'm so far behind! Aack! Don't know where the time goes!\n \nI'm so sorry you're dealing with this friend stuff as well. I hate seeing you ladies go through it. As you said - you want to be happy for someone but it's hard when it hurts your own happiness. I'm s...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1906226\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1444491864","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444763760,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122515,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that snswedding2016 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1906227\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" I can't believe you leave this week!!!! So so excited for you! It all looks fantastic! You look stunning in your dress!!\n \nDo you have a pic of the dufflebag you got from Amazon? I'm on the hunt for good luggage options. We have this great big suitcase but the frame is way too heavy. We were almost over the weight limit when we went to the BDR in Sept....we were only packing for 4 days!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/blink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':blink:' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444755849,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122463,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOh my gosh you're so talented!! So many things coming together! And you're date is coming up so quickly!! Would someone please tell me where the time goes?\n \nDefinitely post your paint art!! Would love to see it!\n \n@  I think that's a pretty cool idea. Catch t...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1906223\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444750845,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122457,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOh my gosh you're so talented!! So many things coming together! And you're date is coming up so quickly!! Would someone please tell me where the time goes?\n \nDefinitely post your paint art!! Would love to see it!\n \n@  I think that's a pretty cool idea. Catch t...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1906223\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444750689,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122455,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\ndeecol just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOh my gosh you're so talented!! So many things coming together! And you're date is coming up so quickly!! Would someone please tell me where the time goes?\n \nDefinitely post your paint art!! Would love to see it!\n \n@  I think that's a pretty cool idea. Catch t...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1906223\n","Sender":{"Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1443808962","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444750609,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122436,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1906221\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" @\"deecol\" A lot of fun! My girls and I had a lot of laughs and drinks haha. Totally worth it. Great experience <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444750036,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122426,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that deecol mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1906220\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" You're the best!  Not dumb or old!\n \nLot's of places & companies that do this:\nhttps:\/\/www.paintnite.com\/ (https:\/\/www.paintnite.com\/)\n \nYou get to have a few drinks, and go home with a pretty painting!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1443808962","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444749908,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122421,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\ndeecol just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOK the dumb old lady here. what is a paint night? Sent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1906143\n","Sender":{"Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1443808962","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444749765,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122409,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThanks ladies! 5 days to go and one week today for our renewal! And of course I broke TWO nails!!! It couldn't be just one. It had to be TWO!! So now I have to get them filled because they look so ridiculous. Oh well.\n \n@RivieraBride15  @Wafflesmom  Thank you both. T...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1906204\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444749313,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122402,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that deecol mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1906216\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" Everything is looking amazing and really coming together!!!!\n \nI am so excited for you!!!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1443808962","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444749045,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122391,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"acw271011,\n\nhopechest has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Grand Coral Beach Club\".\n\nhopechest said:\n======================================================================\nI though that might be the situation. Well thank you so much for your help and congrats on your upcoming renewals!! \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=11739&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":285077,"Name":"hopechest","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444748615,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11739},{"Id":122363,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"acw271011,\n\nhopechest has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Grand Coral Beach Club\".\n\nhopechest said:\n======================================================================\nHello! \nI have been frantically trying to get ahold of someone from Grand Coral Beach Club and I have had no luck. I saw your post about your renewal, CONGRATS!! Any way you can help me with a contact email, I am going to be at playa next week, actually during your renewal (crazy coincidence) and want to stop by to check out the venue. I would really appreciate any help you can offer! Thank you! Frantic soon-to-be-bride Natalia\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=11739#msg20860\n","Sender":{"Id":285077,"Name":"hopechest","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444746852,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11739},{"Id":122355,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThanks ladies! 5 days to go and one week today for our renewal! And of course I broke TWO nails!!! It couldn't be just one. It had to be TWO!! So now I have to get them filled because they look so ridiculous. Oh well.\n \n@RivieraBride15  @Wafflesmom  Thank you both. T...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1906204\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444746022,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122345,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that jbailey270 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76708-azul-fives-brides-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1906203\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" Thank you so much for the advice! That definitely makes us feel a little bit better <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> After planning for so long, it's not the forecast we've been hoping for! Fingers crossed for sunny skies ! See you down there! !\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":285079,"Name":"jbailey270","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285079.jpg?_r=1444898331","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444744869,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122332,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nsnswedding2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nAahhh!  6 days until we leave for Mexico! And finally getting organized I think. Quiet thanksgiving for us today after getting back from the US late last night for the grandsons' birthdays. And I got to pick up my goodies too!! Very happy with everything. Well worth the wait!\n ...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1906173\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444740515,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122327,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nAahhh!  6 days until we leave for Mexico! And finally getting organized I think. Quiet thanksgiving for us today after getting back from the US late last night for the grandsons' birthdays. And I got to pick up my goodies too!! Very happy with everything. Well worth the wait!\n ...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1906173\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444740442,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122324,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Meandhim mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1906195\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\"\n \nEverything looks great! Now to pack it all!! What kind of mini steamer did you get? That ring box and hanger is so cute!! Those bags are a great size! LOVE the shoes! I'm getting excited for you now...you only have a few more days!! Can't wait to hear all about it and see the pictures when you return!! Good Luck with the Job Interviews!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444735205,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"666","TotalPages":23,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":660},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
