{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"80.42.248.77","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7f588539dcf00e16d0bd71d3e51efd75","RawContent":"Oh gosh.....I really hope you are ok! Sending hugs your way \n\n\nMaybeoneday\n\n14 \/10\/2015 - R R C, Mexico","Attachments":[],"Id":1895580,"PostDate":1430946938,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Oh gosh.....I really hope you are ok! Sending hugs your way <br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 \/10\/2015 - R R C, Mexico\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelina_nessa@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"149.254.56.238","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1421807139,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maybeoneday","Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"010785aba451ef9f17f8d716db229861","RawContent":"OMG girl. Hope you are ok!!!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1895584,"PostDate":1430947686,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                OMG girl. Hope you are ok!!!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.126.252.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"120aacd335cfee0f49afa1635318751c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m just catching up on people&#039;s threads. I&#039;m sending you positive vibes!! I&#039;m so sorry all this stuff is happening and I hope that everything is ok. Take it easy with the concussion and don&#039;t demand too much from your brain in the first few days. Some rest can really speed up the healing when it comes to that.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I hope everything gets better soon. Juan and I haven&#039;t been having the best week either. I don&#039;t know what&#039;s up but everything is just insane and all kinds of weird things happening. Probably the full moon haha.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895630,"PostDate":1430997025,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm just catching up on people's threads. I'm sending you positive vibes!! I'm so sorry all this stuff is happening and I hope that everything is ok. Take it easy with the concussion and don't demand too much from your brain in the first few days. Some rest can really speed up the healing when it comes to that.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I hope everything gets better soon. Juan and I haven't been having the best week either. I don't know what's up but everything is just insane and all kinds of weird things happening. Probably the full moon haha.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.174.145","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef774be9aaa2f1f52d7f428528d10141","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh my gosh! What a run of cruddy news. I hope the concussion isn&#039;t too serious! Taking care of yourself is the MOST important thing so rest up!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I do also really love your key card holder with the tags! We ultimately decided not to do them, but I&#039;m still second guessing it. It seems like everyone says their guests loved them!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895767,"PostDate":1431082636,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh my gosh! What a run of cruddy news. I hope the concussion isn't too serious! Taking care of yourself is the MOST important thing so rest up!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I do also really love your key card holder with the tags! We ultimately decided not to do them, but I'm still second guessing it. It seems like everyone says their guests loved them!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403101687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b1e0e2d1d0de10edc269e561981851c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1895497\" timestamp=\"1430918577\"]\nSorry to hear about what you are going thru!  You are a strong lady and I have no doubt, but the process must get so frustrating for you, so hugs!\n \nThe key holders look great, they turned out fantastic!!!\n \nMy boss has stayed at the Yucatan Princess, just late last year.  If you want her review I can email her today, but I never heard any bad, so I have to assume she had a great time![\/quote]Hey Kim That would be a great option!! If you get a chance to ask the opinion would be awesome!! With all that has gone on this week I haven&#039;t gotten back to the TA yet. Pricing is down again though so definitely good options out there.","Attachments":[],"Id":1895866,"PostDate":1431273439,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 06 May 2015 - 09:22 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Sorry to hear about what you are going thru! \u00a0You are a strong lady and I have no doubt, but the process must get so frustrating for you, so hugs!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nThe key holders look great, they turned out fantastic!!!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nMy boss has stayed at the Yucatan Princess, just late last year. \u00a0If you want her review I can email her today, but I never heard any bad, so I have to assume she had a great time!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHey Kim That would be a great option!! If you get a chance to ask the opinion would be awesome!! With all that has gone on this week I haven't gotten back to the TA yet. Pricing is down again though so definitely good options out there.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d34c02906e2c76f069f2fd6b848b2dbb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So today is pretty much the first day that I&#039;m finally comfortable wearing my glasses for extended periods of time. The headache has finally eased off and the cut on the bridge of my nose and the swelling have at last started to go down. I can now get a small ice pack on the side of my face without it being excruciating! lol It has definitely been a few days of \"why me lord?\" lol&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the best wishes ladies. It is more appreciated than you know! My hubby has been SOOOOO unbelievable the last few days even though he had the you know what scared out of him with the way the transit people called him and told him sort of what had happened and for you TO ladies, I have absolutely nothing but fantastic things to say about Toronto General Hospital. Wow! Never been there before but they were amazing.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;All of this has stalled the lung tests because one of the them involves putting a clamp on your nose while you inhale a special mist through a mask that they then track through a scan. So NOT happening right now! Aint nobody going anywhere NEAR my nose right now!! lol So it&#039;s put off until close to the end of the month. It&#039;s ok. I can wait!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895882,"PostDate":1431294964,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So today is pretty much the first day that I'm finally comfortable wearing my glasses for extended periods of time. The headache has finally eased off and the cut on the bridge of my nose and the swelling have at last started to go down. I can now get a small ice pack on the side of my face without it being excruciating! lol It has definitely been a few days of \"why me lord?\" lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for the best wishes ladies. It is more appreciated than you know! My hubby has been SOOOOO unbelievable the last few days even though he had the you know what scared out of him with the way the transit people called him and told him sort of what had happened and for you TO ladies, I have absolutely nothing but fantastic things to say about Toronto General Hospital. Wow! Never been there before but they were amazing.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>All of this has stalled the lung tests because one of the them involves putting a clamp on your nose while you inhale a special mist through a mask that they then track through a scan. So NOT happening right now! Aint nobody going anywhere NEAR my nose right now!! lol So it's put off until close to the end of the month. It's ok. I can wait!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"b8705e98745a91f39675078aaabbf8ba","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"] - Glad you are feeling better and just take it easy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895894,"PostDate":1431304322,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> - Glad you are feeling better and just take it easy.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.126.252.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"f91bae80ce29aa0bcfe39e9a334990dc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m glad to hear that you&#039;re doing better! Hopefully the nose gets better soon to get those tests done :).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895895,"PostDate":1431304678,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm glad to hear that you're doing better! Hopefully the nose gets better soon to get those tests done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.31.82.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55c1cbac3c7d7ef8715c2181e1b260eb","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1895882\" timestamp=\"1431309364\"]\nSo today is pretty much the first day that I&#039;m finally comfortable wearing my glasses for extended periods of time. The headache has finally eased off and the cut on the bridge of my nose and the swelling have at last started to go down. I can now get a small ice pack on the side of my face without it being excruciating! lol It has definitely been a few days of \"why me lord?\" lol\n\nThanks for the best wishes ladies. It is more appreciated than you know! My hubby has been SOOOOO unbelievable the last few days even though he had the you know what scared out of him with the way the transit people called him and told him sort of what had happened and for you TO ladies, I have absolutely nothing but fantastic things to say about Toronto General Hospital. Wow! Never been there before but they were amazing.\n\nAll of this has stalled the lung tests because one of the them involves putting a clamp on your nose while you inhale a special mist through a mask that they then track through a scan. So NOT happening right now! Aint nobody going anywhere NEAR my nose right now!! lol So it&#039;s put off until close to the end of the month. It&#039;s ok. I can wait![\/quote]\nI haven&#039;t really been on here in awhile, so just catching up on your thread... Holy Moly Girl! You must be accident prone! I hope you are taking it easy now and are on the mend! TGH is a great Hospital, been there a couple of times. I hope your nose has healed and you are able to get your tests soon! Take Care! Take it Easy! Sending more positive Vibes your way!","Attachments":[],"Id":1896792,"PostDate":1432221554,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 10 May 2015 - 09:56 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>So today is pretty much the first day that I'm finally comfortable wearing my glasses for extended periods of time. The headache has finally eased off and the cut on the bridge of my nose and the swelling have at last started to go down. I can now get a small ice pack on the side of my face without it being excruciating! lol It has definitely been a few days of \"why me lord?\" lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for the best wishes ladies. It is more appreciated than you know! My hubby has been SOOOOO unbelievable the last few days even though he had the you know what scared out of him with the way the transit people called him and told him sort of what had happened and for you TO ladies, I have absolutely nothing but fantastic things to say about Toronto General Hospital. Wow! Never been there before but they were amazing.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>All of this has stalled the lung tests because one of the them involves putting a clamp on your nose while you inhale a special mist through a mask that they then track through a scan. So NOT happening right now! Aint nobody going anywhere NEAR my nose right now!! lol So it's put off until close to the end of the month. It's ok. I can wait!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I haven't really been on here in awhile, so just catching up on your thread... Holy Moly Girl! You must be accident prone! I hope you are taking it easy now and are on the mend! TGH is a great Hospital, been there a couple of times. I hope your nose has healed and you are able to get your tests soon! Take Care! Take it Easy! Sending more positive Vibes your way!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1365777659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.112.185.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"65076e23b72fab21e64ddf38dc1fad0c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Catching up on some planning threads this morning. Feel like I haven&#039;t been on here too much lately. But my god woman, aren&#039;t you the test of strength. They say that everything that happens to us makes us stronger. Well you must be able to lift a car by now...lol just kidding trying to shed some light.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am glad you are feeling better though and continue on with writing us and letting us know all your details on your planning.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And no more falls.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897347,"PostDate":1432727255,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Catching up on some planning threads this morning. Feel like I haven't been on here too much lately. But my god woman, aren't you the test of strength. They say that everything that happens to us makes us stronger. Well you must be able to lift a car by now...lol just kidding trying to shed some light.<\/p>\n<p>I am glad you are feeling better though and continue on with writing us and letting us know all your details on your planning.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And no more falls.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395332214,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":380,"TotalPages":38,"CurrentPage":100,"NextPage":110,"PreviousPage":90,"LastPage":370},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
