Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"d2812d95894681d69fb0793f4c5d9120","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;yayyy!! SO happy to hear that you booked...and so exciting that I will be there later in your stay!!!! We&#039;ll have to meet up! I will want to hear ALL about the renewal!!!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901613,"PostDate":1438268615,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>yayyy!! SO happy to hear that you booked...and so exciting that I will be there later in your stay!!!! We'll have to meet up! I will want to hear ALL about the renewal!!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;6\/st\/20150314\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/c1c3\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"tiffmedeiros@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361723426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsCtoB","Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.143.70.78","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6b59a3d5a195e19906cc61429d27f604","RawContent":"[quote name=\"MrsCtoB\" post=\"1901613\" timestamp=\"1438283015\"]\nyayyy!! SO happy to hear that you booked...and so exciting that I will be there later in your stay!!!! We&#039;ll have to meet up! I will want to hear ALL about the renewal!!!  :)[\/quote]Oh you can absolutely bet on it!! And we have to get together for a drink!!! Even with you arriving and us leaving we&#039;ll figure something out!\n\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1901614,"PostDate":1438269253,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MrsCtoB, on 30 July 2015 - 03:03 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>yayyy!! SO happy to hear that you booked...and so exciting that I will be there later in your stay!!!! We'll have to meet up! I will want to hear ALL about the renewal!!!  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\nOh you can absolutely bet on it!! And we have to get together for a drink!!! Even with you arriving and us leaving we'll figure something out!<br><br>\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.49.243.226","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"55a20155ab9b879f9a2c165203785355","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"] congrats on booking the resort!! I know the process must have been more than frustrating but it must feel so good to have that settled!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can&#039;t wait to see pics of your dress!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901624,"PostDate":1438293906,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> congrats on booking the resort!! I know the process must have been more than frustrating but it must feel so good to have that settled!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can't wait to see pics of your dress!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1415533111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97693e010316ee6aad3db3ac4198f027","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s your giggle for the night ladies. I had to work late tonight. (so what else is new?) Hubby left with the trailer so I have the house to myself until I drive to meet up with him on Saturday a couple of hours away in New York.&amp;nbsp; I got home and decided rather than driving to my gf&#039;s with my dress, I&#039;d just try it on myself. ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha&amp;nbsp; dumb idea. Um first of all, it&#039;s a corset back. duh. i need help to do it up! And I found out it&#039;s one heck of a lot of dress!!!!! Holy geez! So no pics yet. Well - I could upload the dress pics. Just not with me in it. Yet. The good thing is I figured out which layer of crinoline has to come out. I will absolutely COOK in Mexico if I don&#039;t shrink some layers which I knew I was going to do anyway. But there is more than I was expecting. lol I put the veil on with it and I actually really like it. So the good part of that is that I figured out how much needs to be cut off the veil.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I played around with my key card holders too and swapped out the picture on them now that the resort is booked. I had been using Azul Fives since I thought that was where we would be and the internet has really nice pics of that resort. But I did find a couple of nice ones of Valentin so here is the card redone.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\n&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The other thing is a quick little door card. I don&#039;t know if I&#039;m actually going to use it or not. I got a deal notice from Vistaprint and started to play around. Does anyone know if you can take the back of one of their designs and the front of your own design? I tried finding a photo to put on the back and couldn&#039;t get it to resize properly. It kept telling me that the resolution was no good. So I&#039;m thinking I&#039;ll just print it on white cardstock and leave the back blank.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901629,"PostDate":1438302849,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Here's your giggle for the night ladies. I had to work late tonight. (so what else is new?) Hubby left with the trailer so I have the house to myself until I drive to meet up with him on Saturday a couple of hours away in New York.\u00a0 I got home and decided rather than driving to my gf's with my dress, I'd just try it on myself. ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha\u00a0 dumb idea. Um first of all, it's a corset back. duh. i need help to do it up! And I found out it's one heck of a lot of dress!!!!! Holy geez! So no pics yet. Well - I could upload the dress pics. Just not with me in it. Yet. The good thing is I figured out which layer of crinoline has to come out. I will absolutely COOK in Mexico if I don't shrink some layers which I knew I was going to do anyway. But there is more than I was expecting. lol I put the veil on with it and I actually really like it. So the good part of that is that I figured out how much needs to be cut off the veil.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I played around with my key card holders too and swapped out the picture on them now that the resort is booked. I had been using Azul Fives since I thought that was where we would be and the internet has really nice pics of that resort. But I did find a couple of nice ones of Valentin so here is the card redone.<\/p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=33217\" title=\"\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_extra\/mime_types\/ppt.gif\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=33217\" title=\"\"><strong>our mexico keycard holder Valentin.ppt<\/strong><\/a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class='desc'><strong>291KB<\/strong><\/span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"desc lighter\">10 <\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The other thing is a quick little door card. I don't know if I'm actually going to use it or not. I got a deal notice from Vistaprint and started to play around. Does anyone know if you can take the back of one of their designs and the front of your own design? I tried finding a photo to put on the back and couldn't get it to resize properly. It kept telling me that the resolution was no good. So I'm thinking I'll just print it on white cardstock and leave the back blank.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1438305654,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"328934da9dc207befa91cb8bf6131d21","RawContent":"Hahaha wish you had taken some photos with the dress half over our head or something [emoji6] But at least you got to sneak a peak. \n\n\nWhen looking at flat invitations\/cards on Vistaprint I think a lot of them had an option to upload a photo to the back. Would that work? Probably doesn&#039;t have to be just a photo. Could be something saved as an image file, I would think. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1901630,"PostDate":1438305611,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hahaha wish you had taken some photos with the dress half over our head or something [emoji6] But at least you got to sneak a peak. <br><br>\nWhen looking at flat invitations\/cards on Vistaprint I think a lot of them had an option to upload a photo to the back. Would that work? Probably doesn't have to be just a photo. Could be something saved as an image file, I would think. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"eb6e940b81e241e4a79689a32e28a59a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Cute key card holders! THAT POOL!&amp;nbsp; :wub: &amp;nbsp;I will be eagerly awaiting some dress pics! Yay!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901673,"PostDate":1438431117,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Cute key card holders! THAT POOL!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/> \u00a0I will be eagerly awaiting some dress pics! Yay!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;6\/st\/20150314\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/c1c3\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"tiffmedeiros@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361723426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsCtoB","Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"712f55fc4bd7f7c49be5adab8a281144","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on booking your resort! &amp;nbsp;It looks beautiful and I know that is a load off you for :) &amp;nbsp; Super exciting you may meet up with MrsCtoB there as well!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Love your key card holders!! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can&#039;t wait to see your dress :) &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901682,"PostDate":1438438855,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on booking your resort! \u00a0It looks beautiful and I know that is a load off you for <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0 Super exciting you may meet up with MrsCtoB there as well!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Love your key card holders!! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can't wait to see your dress <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.161.69.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1d77f4e1fe1cca9aadb2991d0b2bd6c0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"vancouverpetunia\" post=\"1901630\" timestamp=\"1438320011\"]\nHahaha wish you had taken some photos with the dress half over our head or something [emoji6] But at least you got to sneak a peak. \nWhen looking at flat invitations\/cards on Vistaprint I think a lot of them had an option to upload a photo to the back. Would that work? Probably doesn&#039;t have to be just a photo. Could be something saved as an image file, I would think. \nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]You&#039;re sweet but believe me when I say that anything showing any state of undress would not be pretty!! lol\n\nI actually was trying to upload a photo on the back of the card but trying to resize one to a vertical length and it just wasn&#039;t working right. I found one of their designs and really liked the back but I couldn&#039;t get everything off the front so that I could put my design on. I don&#039;t know if you cN take a front of one and the back of another and aske them to merge the files or not? It&#039;s not a bid deal. For the number I need it really isn&#039;t worth it. Easier to just stick with mine I think lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1901687,"PostDate":1438463515,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>vancouverpetunia, on 31 July 2015 - 01:20 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hahaha wish you had taken some photos with the dress half over our head or something [emoji6] But at least you got to sneak a peak. <br>\nWhen looking at flat invitations\/cards on Vistaprint I think a lot of them had an option to upload a photo to the back. Would that work? Probably doesn't have to be just a photo. Could be something saved as an image file, I would think. <br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nYou're sweet but believe me when I say that anything showing any state of undress would not be pretty!! lol<br><br>\nI actually was trying to upload a photo on the back of the card but trying to resize one to a vertical length and it just wasn't working right. I found one of their designs and really liked the back but I couldn't get everything off the front so that I could put my design on. I don't know if you cN take a front of one and the back of another and aske them to merge the files or not? It's not a bid deal. For the number I need it really isn't worth it. Easier to just stick with mine I think lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"c62f614abf0bf3ed43ddb4aa2344ae08","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"] Maybe try calling the 800 number they list on the Vistaprint web site? I haven&#039;t called, but it says they are available to help.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901690,"PostDate":1438468155,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> Maybe try calling the 800 number they list on the Vistaprint web site? I haven't called, but it says they are available to help.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.179.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1438870694,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dcd87c5415e7c3a059af5c9dde76eb24","RawContent":"[quote name=\"vancouverpetunia\" post=\"1901690\" timestamp=\"1438482555\"]\n@[member=\"acw271011\"] Maybe try calling the 800 number they list on the Vistaprint web site? I haven&#039;t called, but it says they are available to help.[\/quote]I did think about that actually but then I realized that with what I need there just isn&#039;t any point in bothering with the cost. I thought about TPH or someplace like that and getting them to print for me and not bother with a back side photo. Having said that with all the discounts on Vistaprint I could get what I need for pretty cheap. I keep getting emails from them so maybe I&#039;ll give it another try this weekend.\n\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1902001,"PostDate":1438846486,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>vancouverpetunia, on 01 August 2015 - 10:29 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> Maybe try calling the 800 number they list on the Vistaprint web site? I haven't called, but it says they are available to help.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I did think about that actually but then I realized that with what I need there just isn't any point in bothering with the cost. I thought about TPH or someplace like that and getting them to print for me and not bother with a back side photo. Having said that with all the discounts on Vistaprint\u00a0I could get what I need for pretty cheap. I keep getting emails from them so maybe I'll give it another try this weekend.<br><br>\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":380,"TotalPages":38,"CurrentPage":190,"NextPage":200,"PreviousPage":180,"LastPage":370},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
